<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2" xmlns:gx="http://www.google.com/kml/ext/2.2" xmlns:kml="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom">
<Document id="1wvgFIPuOmI8da9EIB88tHo9vamo">
	<name>General SpaceX Map  [Raul]</name>
	<description>
--- CLICK TO UNROLL MAP INFO: ---

CHECK THE MAP CHANGELOG: 
https://goo.gl/jpBzv2

SUPPORT MAPS !
www.paypal.me/Raul74Cz/10

MAP KEY:
&gt;Red - Launch Facility, Launch Pad
&gt;Orange - SpX Facility, Workshop, Hangar, Equipment
&gt;LightOrange - Proposed SpX Facility
&gt;Yellow - SpX Office, Operations Building, House
&gt;Green - Development Facility, Test Stand, Test Vehicle
&gt;LightBlue(Polygon) - SpaceX Lot, Adjacent Courtyards, Parking Area
&gt;LightGrey - Parked Vehicle
&gt;Black - Abandoned Site, Scrap Yard, Weaned Vehicle, Monument
&gt;YellowGreen - SpX Suppliers
&gt;LightGreen - Temporary Used Test Facility
&gt;Brown - Landing Zone
&gt;Blue - Droneship Recovery Position, Droneship Anchorage
&gt;LightBlue - Water Landing Position
&gt;Violet - Dragon Landing Position
&gt;Grey - Planned-Unused Site
&gt;LightBrown - Washed-up Falcon debris

&gt;Brown Line - F1 Launch Groundtrack Inside Hazard Areas
&gt;Grey Line - F9v1.0. Launch Groundtrack Inside Hazard Areas
&gt;Black Line - F9v1.1. Launch Groundtrack Inside Hazard Areas
&gt;Blue Line - F9v1.2. Launch Groundtrack Inside Hazard Areas
&gt;Red-Violet Line - FH Launch Groundtrack Inside Hazard Areas
&gt;Violet Line - Dragon Landing Groundtrack Inside Hazard Areas
&gt;Green Line - HyperLoop Test Track, Loop Transit Tunnel Project

SPX HAZARD AREAS MAPS:
SpX Hazard Areas#1 F1-F9v1.0 - https://goo.gl/eCeQpU
SpX Hazard Areas#2 F9-006-013 - https://goo.gl/jwEf84
SpX Hazard Areas#3 F9-014-021 - 2015 - https://goo.gl/0YcgoK
SpX Hazard Areas#4 F9-022-029 - 2016 - https://goo.gl/VQKBXz
SpX Hazard Areas#5 - 2017/1 - https://goo.gl/umnY2Q
SpX Hazard Areas#6 - 2017/2 - https://goo.gl/ErbkUw
SpX Hazard Areas#7 - 2018/1 - https://goo.gl/L9HXtj
SpX Hazard Areas#8 - 2018/2 - https://goo.gl/JYk1ey
SpX Hazard Areas#9 - 2018/19- https://goo.gl/HXcS8Q
SpX Hazard Areas#10 - 2019/2 -
http://bit.do/LHA10

RELATED LINK:
Complete Mission Patch Collection - http://imgur.com/a/8gulb

CREATED BY:
Radovan Kubrt [Raul]
NSF/Raul
Reddit/u/Raul74Cz
https://twitter.com/Raul74Cz

SPECIAL THANKS FOR SUPPORT TO:
Amy Hanzl
David Glowacki
Jan Rais
Chris Campbell
David Harris
Petr Melechin
Jonathan McDowell
Gavin Cornwell
Colvin Goree
Menachem Mendel Marsow</description>
