	<Folder id="4c5ae659_0">
		<name>Falcon 1 &amp; Falcon 9 v1.0 - 1.1 flights</name>
		<visibility>0</visibility>
		<styleUrl>#__managed_style_043CC9E8012C6E06344B</styleUrl>
		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_K_UJPTAMVGD410B59A28B362480A">
			<name>F1-001(dev) FalconSAT-2 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F1-001(dev) FalconSAT-2 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/eCeQpU

Launch - 24-Mar-06 - Falcon 1 Dev Flight 1 - RTS Omelek

19.5kg FalconSAT-2 plasma analyzer payload
Planned orbit 400/500km/39°

Corroded nut caused an engine fire - failure of the engine at T+25seconds.

Elon Musk: "I spent the day picking up rocket pieces from the reef, which sucked."</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_048008C3D32C6E06344C</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">F1-001(dev) FalconSAT-2 launch groundtrack</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/eCeQpU

Launch - 24-Mar-06 - Falcon 1 Dev Flight 1 - RTS Omelek

19.5kg FalconSAT-2 plasma analyzer payload
Planned orbit 400/500km/39°

Corroded nut caused an engine fire - failure of the engine at T+25seconds.

Elon Musk: &quot;I spent the day picking up rocket pieces from the reef, which sucked.&quot;</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
			<gx:Carousel>
				<gx:Image kml:id="external_image_aHR0cDovL2kuaW1ndXIuY29tL0ZjSU5EZXUuanBn">
