		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_K_UJPTAMVGD410B59B48D021ECE2">
			<name>F1-002(dev) DemoSat launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F1-002(dev) DemoSat launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/eCeQpU

Launch - 21-Mar-07 - Falcon 1 Dev Flight 2 - RTS Omelek

2kg DemoSat RTF dummy payload
Planned orbit 330/685km/9° initial orbit

First stage bumped the second stage engine bell during staging due to additional aerodynamic forces in lower altitude than expected, because of slightly lower thrust caused by an incorrect propellant utilization by flight computer.
Circular overcompensated oscillation of second stage increasing by sloshing of propellant.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_048008C3D32C6E06344C</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">F1-002(dev) DemoSat launch groundtrack</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/eCeQpU

Launch - 21-Mar-07 - Falcon 1 Dev Flight 2 - RTS Omelek

2kg DemoSat RTF dummy payload
Planned orbit 330/685km/9° initial orbit

First stage bumped the second stage engine bell during staging due to additional aerodynamic forces in lower altitude than expected, because of slightly lower thrust caused by an incorrect propellant utilization by flight computer.
Circular overcompensated oscillation of second stage increasing by sloshing of propellant.</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
