		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_K_UJPTAMVGD410B977516BEF3E1B">
			<name>F9-002 COTS Demo 1 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-002 COTS Demo 1 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/eCeQpU

Launch - 08-Dec-10 - Falcon 9 v1.0 Flight 2 - CCAFS SLC-40

First flight of Dragon spacecraft to Earth orbit - first privately developed spacecraft

Dragon C101 deployed into 288/301km/34.53° orbit

Elon Musk: "We didn't have to go to backup systems at any point. I'm sort of in semishock."

8 additional secondary satellites - SMDC-ONE 1, QbX 1, QbX 2, Mayflower-Caerus, Perseus 000 and Perseus 001-003
Secret payload - Le Brouere cheese

Second stage engine was reignited in orbit - still in 303/10348km/34.5° orbit.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0AF505CC592C6E06344F</styleUrl>
