		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_K_UJPTAMVGD410B97C12656F45F2">
			<name>F9-004	CRS-1 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-004	CRS-1 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/eCeQpU

Launch - 08-Oct-12 - Falcon 9 v1.0 Flight 4 - CCAFS SLC-40

First SpaceX operational CRS mission under NASA contract.

Total Cargo Upmass with packaging - 905kg
Dragon C103 deployed into 197/328km/51.66° orbit

Secondary payload 172kg - Orbcomm FM101 satellite

At T+79sec engine#1 lost pressure and was commanded to shut down - ruptured fuel dome, above the nozzle - longer burn of remaining eight engines
Due to this failure and ISS rendezvous safety protocols, second stage did not attempt a second burn - Orbcomm was left in an unusable orbit - burned up within 4 days</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0AF505CC592C6E06344F</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">F9-004	CRS-1 launch groundtrack</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/eCeQpU

Launch - 08-Oct-12 - Falcon 9 v1.0 Flight 4 - CCAFS SLC-40

First SpaceX operational CRS mission under NASA contract.

Total Cargo Upmass with packaging - 905kg
Dragon C103 deployed into 197/328km/51.66° orbit

Secondary payload 172kg - Orbcomm FM101 satellite

At T+79sec engine#1 lost pressure and was commanded to shut down - ruptured fuel dome, above the nozzle - longer burn of remaining eight engines
Due to this failure and ISS rendezvous safety protocols, second stage did not attempt a second burn - Orbcomm was left in an unusable orbit - burned up within 4 days</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
