			<name>F9-006 CASSIOPE launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-006 CASSIOPE launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/jwEf84

Launch - 29-Sep-13 - Falcon 9 v1.1. (expendable) Flight 6 - VAFB SLC-4E

First Falcon9 v1.1. flight (Merlin1D, octaweb, lengthened stages, stronger construction)
First flight with payload fairing

Total primary+secondary payload mass 561kg - Cassiope 481kg + CUSat 25kg + DANDE 50kg POPACS 4.5kg

Deployment to 325/1500km/81° orbit

Secondary payload - CUSat, DANDE, POPACS 1-3 nanosatellites

Second stage derelict failure - frozen igniter fluid lines - still in 323/1282km/81° orbit</div>]]></description>
