		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_KFPCTKJEXBCI1017A7F92DE262AB">
			<name>F9-006 CASSIOPE water landing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-006 CASSIOPE water landing</div><div><b>description</b>: American Islander MarineTrafic approx.position.

Water Landing - 29-Sep-13 - Falcon 9 v1.1. (expendable) Flight 6 - American Islander support - Landing Failure

Fuel centrifuging due to a high spin rate - hard impact on ocean

@elonmusk 29 Sep 2013:
Rocket booster relit twice (supersonic retro & landing), but spun up due to aero torque, so fuel centrifuged & we flamed out

American Spirit possibly searching for fairing bebris.
18-Jan-15 - fairing debris washed-up on southern tip of Hawaii
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02AE052A052C6E063451</styleUrl>
