					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">American Islander MarineTrafic approx.position.

Water Landing - 29-Sep-13 - Falcon 9 v1.1. (expendable) Flight 6 - American Islander support - Landing Failure

Fuel centrifuging due to a high spin rate - hard impact on ocean

@elonmusk 29 Sep 2013:
Rocket booster relit twice (supersonic retro &amp; landing), but spun up due to aero torque, so fuel centrifuged &amp; we flamed out

American Spirit possibly searching for fairing bebris.
18-Jan-15 - fairing debris washed-up on southern tip of Hawaii
</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
