			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-007 SES-8 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/jwEf84

Launch - 03-Dec-13 - Falcon 9 v1.1. (expendable) Flight 7 - CCAFS SLC-40

First GTO mission - SSTO(superGTO) orbit

3200kg GEO satellite (slot 95°E)

Deployment to 385/79129km/20.5° SSTO orbit (~1500m/s to GEO)

@elonmusk 4 Dec 2013:
Restart was good, apogee raised to 80k km (50k miles). Yes!!!
View of Earth from upper stage rear view camera at 8,000 miles</div>]]></description>
