		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_K_UJPTAMVGD410087D4424F6D989">
			<name>F9-009 CRS-3 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-009 CRS-3 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/jwEf84

Launch - 18-Apr-14 - Falcon 9 v1.1. Flight 9 - CCAFS SLC-40

First mission with landing legs

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass - 1518kg
Trunk payload 571kg - HDEV cameras and OPALS laser instruments
Secondary payload 28kg - ALL-STAR/THEIA, KickSat 1-Sprites, SporeSat 1,/ TestSat-Lite, PhoneSat 2.5 CubeSats

Dragon C105 deployed into 313/332km/51.66° orbit

@elonmusk 24 Feb 2014:
Mounting landing legs (~60 ft span) to Falcon 9 for next month's Space Station servicing flight</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0E49FE9C912C6E063452</styleUrl>
