Launch - 18-Apr-14 - Falcon 9 v1.1. Flight 9 - CCAFS SLC-40

First mission with landing legs

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass - 1518kg
Trunk payload 571kg - HDEV cameras and OPALS laser instruments
Secondary payload 28kg - ALL-STAR/THEIA, KickSat 1-Sprites, SporeSat 1,/ TestSat-Lite, PhoneSat 2.5 CubeSats

Dragon C105 deployed into 313/332km/51.66° orbit

@elonmusk 24 Feb 2014:
Mounting landing legs (~60 ft span) to Falcon 9 for next month&apos;s Space Station servicing flight</SimpleData>
