		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_KFPCTKJEXBCI100AC40C5DDECEEB">
			<name>F9-010 OG2-1 water landing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-010 OG2-1 water landing</div><div><b>description</b>: Estimation - Center of landing area

Water Landing - 14-Jul-14 - Falcon 9 v1.1. Flight 10

Successful soft water landing. Breaks apart after tipping.

@elonmusk 14 Jul 2014:
Rocket booster reentry, landing burn & leg deploy were good, but lost hull integrity right after splashdown (aka kaboom)

13-Aug-14 - fairing debris washed-up on Cape Hatteras, Outer Banks, NC</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02AE052A052C6E063451</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">F9-010 OG2-1 water landing</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Estimation - Center of landing area

Water Landing - 14-Jul-14 - Falcon 9 v1.1. Flight 10

Successful soft water landing. Breaks apart after tipping.

@elonmusk 14 Jul 2014:
Rocket booster reentry, landing burn &amp; leg deploy were good, but lost hull integrity right after splashdown (aka kaboom)

13-Aug-14 - fairing debris washed-up on Cape Hatteras, Outer Banks, NC</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
