		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_K_UJPTAMVGD4100892272EE2C38D">
			<name>F9-011 AsiaSat-8 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-011 AsiaSat-8 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/jwEf84

Launch - 05-Aug-14 - Falcon 9 v1.1. (expendable) Flight 11 - CCAFS SLC-40

4535kg GEO satellite (slot 105.5°E)

Deployment to 185/35786km/24.3° GTO orbit (~1800m/s to GEO)

@elonmusk 5 Aug 2014:
High velocity reentry (2700 lbs/sqft) appeared to succeed, but, as expected, not enough propellant to land for this and the next mission.

Second stage still in 207/30129km/24.5° orbit</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0E49FE9C912C6E063452</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
