					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/jwEf84

Launch - 05-Aug-14 - Falcon 9 v1.1. (expendable) Flight 11 - CCAFS SLC-40

4535kg GEO satellite (slot 105.5°E)

Deployment to 185/35786km/24.3° GTO orbit (~1800m/s to GEO)

@elonmusk 5 Aug 2014:
High velocity reentry (2700 lbs/sqft) appeared to succeed, but, as expected, not enough propellant to land for this and the next mission.

Second stage still in 207/30129km/24.5° orbit</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
