			<name>F9-013 AsiaSat-6 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-013 AsiaSat-6 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/jwEf84

Launch - 07-Sep-14 - Falcon 9 v1.1. (expendable) Flight 12 - CCAFS SLC-40

4428kg GEO satellite (slot 120°E - AsiaSat 6/Thaicom 7)

Deployment to 185/35786km/25.3° GTO orbit (1,770m/s to GEO)

Second stage re-entered the atmosphere over Brazil 28-Dec-2014 - some parts of the stage survived - found 3 COPV tanks and metal ring.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0E49FE9C912C6E063452</styleUrl>
