			<name>F9-012 CRS-4 water landing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-012 CRS-4 water landing</div><div><b>description</b>: Estimation - Center of sideways diverted landing area

Water Landing - 21-Sep-14 - Falcon 9 v1.1. (expendable) Flight 13

Legless booster. Successful reentry, ran out of LOX - hard impact on ocean in rotation.

@elonmusk 18 Oct 2014:
Infrared video of Falcon rocket reentry captured by @NASA tracking cameras

26-Nov-15 - Interstage debris washed-up on Isles of Scilly</div>]]></description>
