			<name>F9-014 CRS-5 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-014 CRS-5 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/0YcgoK

Launch - 10-Jan-15 - Falcon 9 v1.1. Flight 14 - CCAFS SLC-40

First droneship landing attempt
First flight with grid fins

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1901kg
Trunk payload 494kg - CATS

Dragon C107 deployed into 207/347km/51.6° orbit

@elonmusk 22 Nov 2014:
Testing operation of hypersonic grid fins (x-wing config) going on next flight
Base is 300 ft by 100 ft, with wings that extend width to 170 ft. Will allow refuel & rocket flyback in future.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0E49FE9C912C6E063452</styleUrl>
