			<name>F9-016 Eutelsat 115W B &amp; ABS-3A launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-016 Eutelsat 115W B & ABS-3A launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/0YcgoK

Launch - 02-Mar-15 - Falcon 9 v1.1. (expendable) Flight 16 - CCAFS SLC-40

First flight with changed COPV configuration of helium system inside 2nd stage LOX tank from four to three vessels - colder helium.

Totally 4159kg GEO satellites (slot 114.9°W & 3°W)
Deployment to 410/63950km/24.8° SSTO orbit

Second stage stayed in 412/63264km/25.8° orbit
</div>]]></description>
