4730kg GEO satellite (slot 52°E)
Deployment to 185/35786km/25° GTO orbit

Second stage still in 190/33511km/25.1° orbit

@elonmusk 28 Apr 2015
Rocket launch good, satellite in geo transfer orbit. Still so damn intense. Looking fwd to it feeling normal one day.

29-May-15 - fairing debris with two GoPro Cams washed-up on Elbow Cay - Bahamas</div>]]></description>
