		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_K_UJPTAMVGD40FEF01E8C873ADB4">
			<name>F9-020 CRS-7 planned launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-020 CRS-7 planned launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/0YcgoK

Launch - 28-Jun-15 - Falcon 9 v1.1. Flight 19 - CCAFS SLC-40 - Launch Failure

Frist OCISLY recovery platform operation
At T+139s broken helium COPV strut in seccond stage LOX tank - LOX tank burst.

Dragon C109 crashed down to water after F9-RUD in 45km altitude
Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1951kg
Trunk payload 526kg - IDA-1

@elonmusk 27 Jun 2015
Trying for another rocket landing tmrw. This time on the droneship "Of Course I Still Love You". 
@elonmusk 28 Jun 2015
Falcon 9 experienced a problem shortly before first stage shutdown. Will provide more info as soon as we review the data.
There was an overpressure event in the upper stage liquid oxygen tank. Data suggests counterintuitive cause.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0E49FE9C912C6E063452</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">F9-020 CRS-7 planned launch groundtrack</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/0YcgoK

Launch - 28-Jun-15 - Falcon 9 v1.1. Flight 19 - CCAFS SLC-40 - Launch Failure

Frist OCISLY recovery platform operation
At T+139s broken helium COPV strut in seccond stage LOX tank - LOX tank burst.

Dragon C109 crashed down to water after F9-RUD in 45km altitude
Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1951kg
Trunk payload 526kg - IDA-1

@elonmusk 27 Jun 2015
Trying for another rocket landing tmrw. This time on the droneship &quot;Of Course I Still Love You&quot;. 
@elonmusk 28 Jun 2015
Falcon 9 experienced a problem shortly before first stage shutdown. Will provide more info as soon as we review the data.
There was an overpressure event in the upper stage liquid oxygen tank. Data suggests counterintuitive cause.</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
