		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_KFPCTKJEXBCI10766C15D21B05D5">
			<name>F9-019 Jason-3 ASDS position</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-019 Jason-3 ASDS position</div><div><b>description</b>: Hard Droneship Landing - 17-Jan-16 - Falcon 9 v1.1. Flight 21 - Marmac303 JRtI, Int.Freedom tug, NRC Quest support - Landing Failure

Sideways diverted ASDS landing instead RTLS due to absent of environmental approval.

Soft touchdown till 1.3m from center of deck. Landing leg collapsed - lockout collet #3 doesn't latch on one legs, causing it to tip over post landing - explosion. Root cause may have been ice buildup due to condensation from heavy fog at liftoff.

@elonmusk 17 Jan 2016:
However, that was not what prevented it being good. Touchdown speed was ok, but a leg lockout didn't latch, so it tipped over after landing.
Well, at least the pieces were bigger this time! Won't be last RUD, but am optimistic about upcoming ship landing.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/209nnX</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0DA7032B6A2C6E063453</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">F9-019 Jason-3 ASDS position</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Hard Droneship Landing - 17-Jan-16 - Falcon 9 v1.1. Flight 21 - Marmac303 JRtI, Int.Freedom tug, NRC Quest support - Landing Failure

Sideways diverted ASDS landing instead RTLS due to absent of environmental approval.

Soft touchdown till 1.3m from center of deck. Landing leg collapsed - lockout collet #3 doesn&apos;t latch on one legs, causing it to tip over post landing - explosion. Root cause may have been ice buildup due to condensation from heavy fog at liftoff.

@elonmusk 17 Jan 2016:
However, that was not what prevented it being good. Touchdown speed was ok, but a leg lockout didn&apos;t latch, so it tipped over after landing.
Well, at least the pieces were bigger this time! Won&apos;t be last RUD, but am optimistic about upcoming ship landing.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/209nnX</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
