		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_K_UJPTAMVGD40FC8649DF4ABACA8">
			<name>F9-021 OG2-2 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-021 OG2-2 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/0YcgoK

Launch - 22-Dec-15 - Falcon 9 v1.2 Flight 20 - CCAFS SLC-40

RTF flight after F9-020 CRS-7 launch failure.
First Falcon9 v1.2. flight (33% higher performance, densified propellants, M1D-FT - increased thrust by 15%, lengthened 2nd stage by 10%, lenghted MVac nozzle-interstage, central pusher, upgrade of boster structure, gridfins, legs, octaweb)

Total payload ~2364kg - Orbcomm FM105, FM108, FM110, FM112, FM113, FM114, FM115, FM116, FM117, FM118, FM119 (172kg), Orbcomm-OG2 Mass Simulator (142kg), 3x MOOG Espa rings (110kg)

Deployment to 614/656km/47° orbit
</div>]]></description>
