Total payload ~2364kg - Orbcomm FM105, FM108, FM110, FM112, FM113, FM114, FM115, FM116, FM117, FM118, FM119 (172kg), Orbcomm-OG2 Mass Simulator (142kg), 3x MOOG Espa rings (110kg)

