		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_13475EB61B16B2AE">
			<name>F9-021 OG2-2 LZ-1 landing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-021 OG2-2 LZ-1 landing</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 22-Dec-15 - Falcon 9 v1.2. Flight 20, booster B1019 - CCAFS LZ-1

First successful Falcon 9 RTLS landing - 3m from LZ-1 landing pad center.
Booster displayed front of Hawthorne SpaceX HQ.

@elonmusk 22 Dec 2015:
11 satellites deployed to target orbit and Falcon has landed back at Cape Canaveral. Headed to LZ-1. Welcome back, baby!
</div>]]></description>
