Launch - 04-Mar-16 - Falcon 9 v1.2 Flight 22 - CCAFS SLC-40

5271kg GEO satellite (slot 108.2°E)
Deployment to 334/40648km/27.96° orbit - planned apogee 39300km(+45days) - modificated from initial 26000km(+93days)

@elonmusk 5 Mar 2016:
Target altitude of 40,600 km achieved. Thanks @SES_Satellites for riding on Falcon 9! Looking forward to future missions.

Visible performed ACS experiment on the passive half of PLF.

Second stage still in 323/40654km/28° orbit</SimpleData>
