		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_KFPCTKJEXBCI10216A3284BD9FB6">
			<name>F9-022 SES-9 ASDS position</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-022 SES-9 ASDS position</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 04-Mar-16 - Falcon 9 v1.2. Flight 22 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Elsbeth III tug, Go Quest support - Landing Failure

662km downrange
High speed reentry after 2.5km/s separation, with critically low fuel margin.
Hard impact to droneship due to failed 3 engine landing burn - very low thrust of one engine - possibly gas ingestion in LOX tank.
Crash to droneship at about 145km/h during ~5sec of landing burn - punched deck at aft port side - upper part of booster left on board.

@elonmusk 5 Mar 2016:
Rocket landed hard on the droneship. Didn't expect this one to work (v hot reentry), but next flight has a good chance.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/up13ae</div>]]></description>
			<gx:fid>0x0:0x0</gx:fid>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0DA7032B6A2C6E063453</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">F9-022 SES-9 ASDS position</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Landing - 04-Mar-16 - Falcon 9 v1.2. Flight 22 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Elsbeth III tug, Go Quest support - Landing Failure

662km downrange
High speed reentry after 2.5km/s separation, with critically low fuel margin.
Hard impact to droneship due to failed 3 engine landing burn - very low thrust of one engine - possibly gas ingestion in LOX tank.
Crash to droneship at about 145km/h during ~5sec of landing burn - punched deck at aft port side - upper part of booster left on board.

@elonmusk 5 Mar 2016:
Rocket landed hard on the droneship. Didn&apos;t expect this one to work (v hot reentry), but next flight has a good chance.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/up13ae</SimpleData>
