		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_KFPCTKJEXBCI1177C5744755635E">
			<name>F9-023 CRS-8 ASDS position</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-023 CRS-8 ASDS position</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 08-Apr-16 - Falcon 9 v1.2. Flight 23, booster B1021 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Elsbeth III tug, Go Quest support

First successful Falcon 9 ASDS landing.
Booster B1021 intended for first reuse (SES-10 mission).

295km downrange
Approx 11m off center landing (right-aft) in stronger surface wind about 11m/s (max wind during descent 22m/s). Slid for more than 2meters and tilted for 2-3 degrees by wind after touch down.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/dnVaPo

Initially planned ASDS possition: https://goo.gl/xK0M4s (CRS-5,6,7 identical)</div>]]></description>
