			<name>F9-024 JCSat-14 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-024 JCSat-14 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/VQKBXz

Launch - 06-May-16 - Falcon 9 v1.2. Flight 24 - CCAFS SLC-40

4696.2 kg GEO satellite (slot 154°E)
Deployment to 189/35957km/23.70° orbit
Second stage re-entered the atmosphere on 16-Sep-2017

@elonmusk 6 May 2016:
Rocket reentry is a lot faster and hotter than last time, so odds of making it are maybe even, but we should learn a lot either way
</div>]]></description>
