			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-026 Eutelsat-117WB&ABS-2A launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/VQKBXz

Launch - 15-Jun-16 - Falcon 9 v1.2. Flight 26 - CCAFS SLC-40

Totally ~4100kg GEO satellites (slot 116.8°W & 75°E)
Deployment to 398/62750km/24.68° orbit

@elonmusk 15 Jun 2016:
