Three-engines deceleration - slow (&gt;6sec) central engine hovering descent (T/W=1) - LOX depletion just above (19m) the deck - hard touch-down- tip over.

@elonmusk 15 Jun 2016:
Ascent phase &amp; satellites look good, but booster rocket had a RUD on droneship.
