			<name>F9-027 CRS-9 LZ-1 landing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-027 CRS-9 LZ-1 landing</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 18-Jul-16 - Falcon 9 v1.2. Flight 27 - CCAFS LZ-1

Successful Falcon 9 first stage landing at LZ-1

Slow single engine landing burn.

‏@elonmusk 18 Jul 2016:
Out on LZ-1. We just completed the post-landing inspection and all systems look good. Ready to fly again.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/HeZMjx</div>]]></description>
