			<name>F9-028 JCSat-16 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-028 JCSat-16 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/VQKBXz

Launch - 14-Aug-16 - Falcon 9 v1.2. Flight 28 - CCAFS SLC-40

~4680 kg GEO satellite (slot 162°E)
Deployment to 184/35912km/20.85° orbit

Second stage re-entered the atmosphere over over the Java Sea 26-Sep-2016. At least two COPV and other parts were reported falling on small islands of Giliraja and Giligenting, in Sumenep Regency on eastern end of Madura Island located north-east of Java.
</div>]]></description>
