		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_179B4AC778901E5A">
			<name>F9-030 Iridium-1 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-030 Iridium-1 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/umnY2Q

Launch - 14-Jan-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 Flight 29 - VAFB SLC-4E

RTF flight after F9-029 Amos-6 static fire mishap.
Temporary solutions: COPV configuration of 2nd stage LOX tank changed back from three to four vessels - warmer helium. Modified helium loading - slower loading operations.

Totally 9600kg payload - 10x860kg IridiumNEXT satellites 1-10 with 1000kg dispenser
Deployment to 618/627km/86.66° orbit

@elonmusk 14 Jan 2017:
Mission looks good. Started deploying the 10 Iridium satellites. Rocket is stable on the droneship.
All satellites deployed
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02207D65342C6E063455</styleUrl>
