		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_15E243344AA90F58">
			<name>F9-030 Iridium-1 ASDS position</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-030 Iridium-1 ASDS position</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 14-Jan-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 B1029 Flight 29 - Marmac303 JRtI, Pacific Warrior tug, NRC Quest support

372km downrange
First succesful west coast landing on JRtI drone ship.

MECO at 1937m/s, 1-3-1 engines 30s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 16s entry burn, single engine 32s successful landing burn.
4m from bullseye droneship landing.
Approx.0.5 degree tilt by crush core absorbing in tuchdown.

@elonmusk 14 Jan 2017:
Mission looks good. Started deploying the 10 Iridium satellites. Rocket is stable on the droneship.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/fjxkWB</div>]]></description>
