		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_185113FA0896A7B3">
			<name>F9-032 CRS-10 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-032 CRS-10 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/umnY2Q

Launch - 19-Feb-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 Flight 30 - KSC LC-39A

First SpX Falcon9 flight from LC-39A.
First SpaceX launch with 'throwback' T/E
First operational SpX flight using autonomous FTS

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1530kg
Trunk payload 960kg - SAGE-III, SAGE NVP, STP-H5/ISEM
Dragon C112 deployed into 202/357km/51.63° orbit

Mission swap allowing additional testing of ground systems ahead of the CRS-10 mission.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02207D65342C6E063455</styleUrl>
