		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_17E28E7941E55082">
			<name>F9-031 EchoStar-23 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-031 EchoStar-23 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/umnY2Q

Launch - 16-Mar-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 (expendable) Flight 31 - KSC LC-39A

First expendable flight of F9v1.2 booster (B1030).
Last flight utilizing ground-based FTS

~5500kg GEO satellite (slot 44.9°W)
Deployment to 179/35903km/22.43° orbit

Booster MECO at 2.67 km/s vs 1.65km/s for a high-margin recovery mission.

S2 decayed 06 Feb 2022 ~08:05 UTC over La Paz, Baja California Sur.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02207D65342C6E063455</styleUrl>
