		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_191253A267561DAF">
			<name>F9-033 SES-10 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-033 SES-10 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/umnY2Q

Launch - 30-Mar-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2. Flight 32 - KSC LC-39A

World’s first reflight of F9 booster on orbital mission.
First successfull payload fairing water landing. Fairing debris spotted on GoSearcher boat  - https://imgur.com/gallery/qa2rB

5281.7kg GEO satellite (slot 67.5°W)
Deployment to 218/35410km/26.2° orbit

@elonmusk 31 Mar 2017:
Incredibly proud of the SpaceX team for achieving this milestone in space! Next goal is reflight within 24 hours.</div>]]></description>
