		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_18F6B41286328491">
			<name>M1363 NROL-76 LZ-1 landing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1363 NROL-76 LZ-1 landing</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 01-May-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 B1032 Flight 33 - CCAFS LZ-1

MECO at 1685m/s, 1-3-1 engines 45s boostback burn, apogee 166km, 1-3-1 engines 25s entry burn, reentry at 840m/s, single engine 30s successful landing burn.

Booster will be getting a ready for another launch for future mission in remain the year.[21:35 Launch Webcast]

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/jlnrGY
</div>]]></description>
