			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: F9-34 Inmarsat-5 F4 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/umnY2Q

Launch - 15-May-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3/4 (expendable) Flight 34 - KSC LC-39A

Heaviest SuperGTO payload, originally supposed to launch on Falcon Heavy.
Successfull payload fairing water landing.
Expendable legless booster B1034

6086kg GEO satellite
Deployment to 385/70134km/24.52° orbit
</div>]]></description>
