		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_18F6B517E6ABB219">
			<name>CRS-11 LZ-1 landing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CRS-11 LZ-1 landing</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 03-Jun-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 B1035 Flight 35 - CCAFS LZ-1

MECO at 1685m/s, 1-3-1 engines 52s boostback burn, apogee 120km, reentry at 993m/s, single engine 33s successful landing burn.
8m from bullseye landing.

@elonmusk 04 Jun 2017:
Yeah, pretty much dead center. We painted the target area with radio reflective paint, which helps the radar be more precise.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/n3GsDR</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B19BD3FD62C6E063456</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
