		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_1B0203EC067F7878">
			<name>M1372 Intelsat-35e launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1372 Intelsat-35e launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/umnY2Q

Launch - 05-Jul-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3/4 (expendable) Flight 38 - KSC LC-39A

Heaviest SpaceX GTO payload
Expendable legless booster B1037, MECO at 2631m/s

6761.1kg GEO satellite (slot 34.5°W)

Deployment to 296/42742km/25.85°orbit

@elonmusk 06 Jul 2017:
Thanks @INTELSAT! Really proud of the rocket and SpaceX team today. Min apogee requirement was 28,000 km, Falcon 9 achieved 43,000 km.
</div>]]></description>
