			<name>CRS-12 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CRS-12 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/ErbkUw

Launch - 14-Aug-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b4 Flight 39 - KSC LC-39A

First flight of Block 4 booster (B1039)
Reused landing legs (from BulgariaSat-1), with white landing leg top-inner side. AL type of grid fins.
Last new-build Dragon

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1652kg
Trunk payload 1258kg - CREAM
Dragon C113 deployed into approx. 200/360km/51.6° orbit
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02207D65342C6E063455</styleUrl>
