First flight of Block 4 booster (B1039)
Reused landing legs (from BulgariaSat-1), with white landing leg top-inner side. AL type of grid fins.
Last new-build Dragon

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1652kg
Trunk payload 1258kg - CREAM
Dragon C113 deployed into approx. 200/360km/51.6° orbit
</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
