			<name>CRS-12 LZ-1 landing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CRS-12 LZ-1 landing</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 14-Aug-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b4 B1039 Flight 39 - CCAFS LZ-1

MECO at 1622m/s, 1-3-1 engines 52s boostback burn, apogee 118km, 1-3-1 engines 14s entry burn, reentry at 917m/s, single engine 32s successful landing burn.
3m from bullseye landing.

