		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_1C66D0B664E55844">
			<name>M1348 OTV-5 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1348 OTV-5 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Estimated track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/ErbkUw

Launch - 07-Sep-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b4 Flight 41 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1040, AL type of grid fins
Approx. 5400kg spaceplane Boeing X-37B aka the Orbital Test Vehicle (OTV)
Launch to 43° orbit, later S2 inclination change burn and deployment to approx. 313/325km/63.58° orbit

Stage2 performed inclination change maneuver to 63.58° together with deorbit burn after 4-8hrs coast.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02207D65342C6E063455</styleUrl>
