		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_1D2394C20A6E9232">
			<name>M1370 SES-11 real ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1370 SES-11 real ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 11-Oct-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 B1031.2 Flight 43 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

Hawk tug MarineTraffic recovery position.
650km downrange, from initially plannned position 32 km to north-east

MECO at 2291m/s, apogee 119km, 1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn, reentry at 1666m/s, 1-3-1 engines successful landing burn.

4 from bullseye landing with approx. 2° tilt. 
 Post landing fire of leaked RP-1 caused damage area of port-stern Thrustmaster's HPU and Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0DA7032B6A2C6E063453</styleUrl>
