		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_1D3C781423FC9916">
			<name>M1381 CRS-13 LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1381 CRS-13 LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 15-Dec-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 B1035.2 Flight 45 - CCAFS LZ-1

MECO at 1658m/s. 1-3-1 engines 50s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 20s entry burn, single engine 31s successful landing burn.
6m from bullseye landing.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/nBJfz9

May 9, 2019 - The first SpaceX rocket to launch on two NASA missions will soon land on exhibit in Houston.
http://www.collectspace.com/news/news-050919a-spacex-falcon9-space-center-houston.html
</div>]]></description>
