			<name>M1340 Iridium-4 booster water landing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1340 Iridium-4 booster water landing</div><div><b>description</b>: Water landing - 23-Dec-17 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 B1036.2 (Expendable) Flight 46 - NRC Quest support

