			<name>M1390 Zuma LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1390 Zuma LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 08-Jan-18 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b4 B1043 Flight 47 - CCAFS LZ-1

MECO at 1673m/s, 1-3-1 engines 35s boostback burn, apogee 125km, 1-3-1 engines 17s entry burn, reentry at 846m/s, single engine 28s successful landing burn.
Bullseye landing.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/1pM7NE
</div>]]></description>
