			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1389 GovSat-1 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Estimated track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/L9HXtj

Launch - 31-Jan-18 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b3 Flight 48 - CCAFS SLC-40

Sooty expendable legged booster 1032.2., AL type of grid fins, Fairing 1.0.
Approx.4230kg GEO satellite GovSat-1/SES-16 (slot 21.5°E)
Deployment to approx. 255/58000km/25.1° SSTO orbit
</div>]]></description>
