		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_1D3CF0F26C5765B8">
			<name>M1346 FH Demo LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1346 FH Demo LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 06-Feb-18 - FH v1.2.b3-4 PY-B1023.2 Flight 1 - CCAFS LZ-1

First successful synchronized landing of FH side boosters. First 3 engines LZ landing burn. Side cores reflyable, but not to be reflown.

MECO at 1910m/s, 1-3-1 engines 79s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 11s entry burn, 1-3-1 engines 17s successful landing burn.
~29m from bullseye landing.

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/fqHN1s
</div>]]></description>
