		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_1F831AEDEABEB7D3">
			<name>M1346 FH Demo real ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1346 FH Demo real ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 06-Feb-18 - FH v1.2.b3 CC-B1033 Flight 1 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

Hawk tug MarineTraffic recovery position.
505km downrange, from initially plannned position 164 km to the east

MECO at 2628m/s, 1-3-1 engines 49s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 20s entry burn, 11s landing burn.

Landing unsuccesful. Center core failed 3-engine landing burn and hit the water at roughly 500km/h close to the droneship starboard side. Two droneship thrusters posssibly lightly damaged by shrapnels.

@elonmusk 12 Feb 2018:
Not enough ignition fluid to light the outer two engines after several three engine relights. Fix is pretty obvious.
</div>]]></description>
