		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_1F45BD084EAF4B58">
			<name>M1393 Hispasat 30W-6 booster water landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1393 Hispasat 30W-6 booster water landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Water landing - 06-Mar-18 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b4 B1044 Flight 50 - Gulfstream G650 telemetry data receiving

633km downrange

MECO at 2287m/s, 1-3-1 engines ~23s entry burn
Succesful water landing sequence not confirmed.

Initially planned booster recovery by Marmac304 OCISLY cancelled due to unfavorable weather conditions in the recovery area.
FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/GqkGZK
</div>]]></description>
