		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_208C030BFAE3B772">
			<name>M1341 Iridium-5 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1341 Iridium-5 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Mr.Steven High Speed Fairing Boat MarineTraffic recovery position "YOUR MOMSHOUSE".

673km downrange

Fairing 1.0
Successful water recovery attempt of one half of the payload fairing.

@elonmusk 30 Mar 2018 
GPS guided parafoil twisted, so fairing impacted water at high speed. Air wake from fairing messing w parafoil steering. Doing helo drop tests in next few weeks to solve.
@elonmusk 02 Apr 2018 
Oh yeah, forgot to mention it actually landed fine, just not on Mr Steven
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0A6A2036232C6E063458</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">M1341 Iridium-5 fairing recovery position
</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Mr.Steven High Speed Fairing Boat MarineTraffic recovery position &quot;YOUR MOMSHOUSE&quot;.

673km downrange

Fairing 1.0
Successful water recovery attempt of one half of the payload fairing.

@elonmusk 30 Mar 2018 
GPS guided parafoil twisted, so fairing impacted water at high speed. Air wake from fairing messing w parafoil steering. Doing helo drop tests in next few weeks to solve.
@elonmusk 02 Apr 2018 
Oh yeah, forgot to mention it actually landed fine, just not on Mr Steven
</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
