			<name>M1380 TESS ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1380 TESS ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 18-Apr-18 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b4 B1045 Flight 53 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

302km downrange

MECO at 1897m/s, 1-3-1 engines 25s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 21s entry burn, single engine 30s successful landing burn.
2m from bullseye landing, secured by Octograbber (by three of the four arms only).

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/jnjJkh
</div>]]></description>
