			<name>M1420 Iridium-6/GRACE-FO fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1420 Iridium-6/GRACE-FO fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Mr.Steven High Speed Fairing Boat MarineTraffic recovery position "IRIDIUM GRACE".

887km downrange

Fairing 2.0.
Both fairings halves successfully deployed their parachutes and landed in the water very close to MrSteven. Active half ~50m from MrSteven.
Successful water recovery of both intact payload fairing halves.
</div>]]></description>
