			<name>M1397 Telstar-19V ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1397 Telstar-19V ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 22-Jul-18 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1047 Flight 58 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

Hawk tug MarineTraffic recovery position.

629km downrange

MECO at 2238m/s, 1-3-1 engines 23s entry burn, single engine ~26s successful landing burn.
Bullseye landing, secured by Octograbber (by three of the four arms only).
</div>]]></description>
