		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_22E4CDE730819E02">
			<name>M1342 Iridium-7 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1342 Iridium-7 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Mr.Steven High Speed Fairing Boat MarineTraffic recovery position "IRIDIUM 7".

593km downrange

Fairing 2.0.

Mr. Steven did see the payload fairing coming down, but didn't able to chatch it to the net due to bad weather with wind shear.
One intact fairing half recovered after water landing.
</div>]]></description>
