</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1385 Es’hail-2 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/JYk1ey

Launch - 15-Nov-18 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 63 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1047.2, fairing 1.0.
First flight with COPV 2.0 crew modification on the second stage.

~3000kg GEO satellite Es'hail-2 (AMSAT P4A) (slot 26°E).
Deployment to 201/37688km/25.02° GTO orbit
</div>]]></description>
