			<name>M1396 SSO-A ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1396 SSO-A ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 03-Dec-18 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1046.3 Flight 64 - Marmac303 JRtI, Pacific Freedom tug, NRC Quest support

Pacific Freedom tug & NRC Quest boat MarineTraffic position "POINT CONCEPTION"&"LZ 9".
Alternative to RTLS landing.
48.4km westward VAFB

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/XySqhc

MECO at 1566m/s, 1-3-1 engines 35s boostback, 1-3-1 engines 25s entry burn, single engine 33s successful landing burn.
2m from bullseye landing.
</div>]]></description>
