			<name>M1396 SSO-A fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1396 SSO-A fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Mr.Steven High Speed Fairing Boat MarineTraffic recovery position "SSO".

344km downrange

Fairing 2.0.

@elonmusk 03 Dec 2018:
Falcon fairing halves missed the net, but touched down softly in the water. Mr Steven is picking them up. Plan is to dry them out & launch again. Nothing wrong with a little swim.
</div>]]></description>
