		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_25B72F813844B2BE">
			<name>M1376 GPS III SV01 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1376 GPS III SV01 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/HXcS8Q

Launch - 23-Dec-18 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 66 - CCAFS SLC-40

Expendable legless booster 1054 without grid fins.
First fairing 2.1. with extra thermal protection on the tip, due to the increased heating on this launch trajectory.
First flight with COPV 2.0 crew modification on both first and second stage.
SpaceX’s first competitively awarded EELV.
USAF second contracted flight GPS III-2.
Stage 2 deorbit in southeast atlantic between T+05h44m - T+07h38m

Approx. 4400kg MEO satellite GPS III-SV03 (Matthew Henson, ex Columbus, NAVSTAR 76, USA 304).
Deployment into 1199/20207km/55.01° orbit
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
