			<name>M1376 GPS III SV01 initially planned fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1376 GPS III SV01 initially planned fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Go Pursuit MarineTraffic position in first launch attempt 18-Dec-18. 
Estimated landing position 934km downrange

New fairing 2.1. (with extra thermal protection on the tip)

Landing possible, recovery cancelled. GoPursuit wasn't in landing area because of rough seas and high winds in launch day.
</div>]]></description>
