			<name>M1343 Iridium-8 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1343 Iridium-8 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 11-Jan-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1049.2 Flight 67 - Marmac303 JRtI, Pacific Freedom tug, NRC Quest support "LZ F9", John Henry support

244km downrange, identical position as M1339 Iridium-3 and M1342 Iridium-7 ASDS position

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/2tReyf

MECO at 1896m/s, 1-3-1 engines 25s boostback burn, apogee 105km, 1-3-1 engines 16s entry burn, reentry at 869m/s, single engine ~30s successful landing burn.
~7m from bullseye landing.
</div>]]></description>
