		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_271CA3831ABEDD27">
			<name>M1384 PSN-6 launch groundtrack</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1384 PSN-6 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/HXcS8Q

Launch - 22-Feb-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 68 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1048.3, Fairing 2.1. with extra thermal protection on the tip, S2 with COPV 2.0.
Fairing recovery didn't performed due to Mr Steven arms damage at sea.

Totally 4850kg payload - 4100 kg GEO setellite Nusantara Satu (PSN-6 - Pasifik Satelit Nusantara 6) (slot 146°E) + 585 kg SpaceIL Moon lander Beresheet + 60kg GEO MicroSat S5

Deployment to 259/69036km/27.55° GTO orbit
</div>]]></description>
