		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_273EDFD9603D6425">
			<name>M1377 CCP-DM1 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1377 CCP-DM1 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/HXcS8Q

Launch - 02-Mar-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 69 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1051, S1/S2 with COPV 2.0
First Dragon 2 (Crew Dragon) demo mission

Total Crew Dragon mass - 12055kg at ISS docking
Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass - 204 kg of crew supplies and equipment 
Anthropomorphic Test Device (ATD) "Ripley" in spacesuit.
Zero-G indicator "Earthy"

Dragon C204 deployed into 194/357km/51.64° initial orbit

@elonmusk 02 Mar 2019:
Super high tech zero-g indicator added just before launch!
Earth floats gently in zero gravity
</div>]]></description>
