		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_26A98AD2876E51C1">
			<name>M1392 Arabsat 6A (FH-02) ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1392 Arabsat 6A (FH-02) ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing -11-Apr-19 - FH v1.2.b5 Flight 2 CenterCore-B1055 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hollywood tug, Go Quest support

967 km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/F7ZLGa

MECO at 2981m/s, 1-3-1 engines ??s entry burn, 1-3-1 engines 12s succesful landing burn.
5m from bullseye landing.

Center core later toppled over due to rough seas with swells as high as 3 m. Crews or Octagrabber could not secure the booster on the droneship.
@elonmusk 16 Apr 2019:
(Can the octagrabber be used?) It can, but the attachment fixtures are different from standard F9 & they weren’t ready in time
Engines seem ok, pending inspection
</div>]]></description>
