		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28273117C7BFAD2A">
			<name>M1392 Arabsat-6A (FH-02) fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1392 Arabsat-6A (FH-02) fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Searcher and GO Navigator MarineTraffic recovery positions.

1029km downrange

New fairing 2.1. (with extra thermal protection on the tip).

Active half recovered by GO Searcher. Passive half recovered by GO Navigator.

@elonmusk 12 Apr 2019:
Both fairing halves recovered. Will be flown on Starlink mission later this year.
Recovered from water, but undamaged
</div>]]></description>
