		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28FC007CCFD1655F">
			<name>M1488 Starlink-1 fairing recovery position</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1488 Starlink-1 fairing recovery position</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Searcher and GO Navigator MarineTraffic recovery positions.

724km downrange

New fairing 2.1-s (tip thermal protection) without acoustic tiles.
First flight of fairing configuration s - without acoustic tiles (Starlink configuration).

Active half recovered by GO Navigator. Passive half recovered by GO Searcher.

@elonmusk 24 May 2019:
Fairing halves recovered
</div>]]></description>
