			<name>M1349 RCM LZ-4 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1349 RCM LZ-4 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 12-Jun-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1051.2 Flight 72 - VAFB LZ-4

MECO at 1582m/s, 1-3-1 engines 45s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 22s entry burn, single engine 33s successful landing burn.
4m from bullseye landing.

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/89054
</div>]]></description>
