			<name>STP-2 (FH-03) fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: STP-2 (FH-03) fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Navigator MarineTraffic recovery position.

1346km downrange

New fairing 2.1. (tip thermal protection).

Passive fairing half captured to the net of GO Ms.Tree. Damaged active half recovered from the water by GO Navigator.
@elonmusk 25 Jun 2019:
Ms. Tree caught the Falcon fairing!!
@elonmusk 04 Jul 2019:
Rocket fairing returning from space
Landing on Ms. Tree
</div>]]></description>
