		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2A1D4BFE7C404F68">
			<name>M1406 CRS-18 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1406 CRS-18 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas https://goo.gl/HXcS8Q

Launch - 25-Jul-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 73 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1056.2

First time the Dragon fly on the 3rd mission.
Grey bend across RP1 part of the second stage that affect temperature of the fuel.
Dragon is outfitted with four ceramic heat shield tiles in testing for Starship vehicle.

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1,778 kg
Trunk payload 534kg - IDA-3
Dragon C108.3 deployed into 210.8/394.7km/51.63° initial orbit
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
