		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2A1D4CA86A8A9D4A">
			<name>M1406 CRS-18 LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1406 CRS-18 LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 25-Jul-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1056.2 Flight 73 - CCAFS LZ-1

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/91764

MECO at 1643m/s. 1-3-1 engines 52s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 21s entry burn, single engine 32s successful landing burn.
3m from bullseye landing.
Landing legs stowed.

@elonmusk 28 Jul 2019:
Falcon rocket reentry from space with double sonic booms
</div>]]></description>
