			<name>M1431 Amos-17 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1431 Amos-17 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA10

Launch - 06-Aug-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 74 - CCAFS SLC-40

Expendable legless booster 1047.3, no grid fins, fairing 2.1. (tip thermal protection).

~6500kg GEO satellite (slot 17°E).
Deployment to 221/35751km/26.08° GTO orbit
</div>]]></description>
