		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2A7D5165366B57D8">
			<name>M1431 Amos-17 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1431 Amos-17 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Navigator MarineTraffic recovery position.

923km downrange

New fairing 2.1. (tip thermal protection).
Passive fairing half captured to the net of GO Ms.Tree. Active half recovered intact from the water by GO Navigator.

@elonmusk 07 Aug 2019:
Fairing caught, video posting soon
Rocket fairing falls from space & is caught by Ms Tree boat
</div>]]></description>
