		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2C558DA2B4072A42">
			<name>M1455 Starlink_V1.0-L1 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1455 Starlink_V1.0-L1 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA10

Launch - 11-Nov-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 75 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1048.4 - first 4th reflight of a F9, first reflight of recovered fairing 2.1-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. First batch of 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°
Heaviest payload to date.
Deployment to approx. 296.7/302km/53° orbit
</div>]]></description>
