		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2C7389582753287E">
			<name>M1455 Starlink_V1.0-L1 planned fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1455 Starlink_V1.0-L1 planned fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms.Chief planned recovery position.

Approx. 730km downrange

Fairing 2.1-s (tip thermal protection) without acoustic tiles.
First reflight of recovered Fairing (ex FH Arabsat-6A).

Fairing recovery cancelled due to weather. GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms.Chief have been called off from recovery zone to Morehead City Port.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0A6A2036232C6E063458</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
