		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2CC0A72F9A6E1C8E">
			<name>M1407 CRS-19 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1407 CRS-19 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA10

Launch - 05-Dec-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 76 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1059

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1693 kg
Trunk payload 924kg - HISUI, Li-ion Batt
Dragon C106.3 deployed into 211/385km/51.64° orbit.

Stage2 performed 20.1s inclination change maneuver to 58.6° together with deorbit burn after 5-6hrs thermal demo coast to demostrate launches capability to GEO orbit.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
