		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2CA593C712948FCF">
			<name>M1407 CRS-19 ASDS position</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1407 CRS-19 ASDS position</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 05-Dec-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 76 B1059 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

345km offshore (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/96556

Formerly planned landing to LZ-1 http://bit.do/95323 cancelled due to extra performace for stage2 long coast thermal demonstration with deorbit burn to orbit inc~58°.

MECO at 2087m/s. 1-3-1 engines 27s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 9s entry burn, single engine ~28s succesful landing burn.
5m from bullseye landing, secured by all arms of Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
