Active fairing half recovered from the water by GO Ms.Tree. Then used only as practice fairing.
Passive fairing half recovered from the water by GO Ms.Chief.

@elonmusk 17 Dec 2019:
Sigh …
Telemetry indicates soft touchdown on the water, so fairing might still be reusable
