			<name>M1489 Starlink_v1.0-L2 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1489 Starlink_v1.0-L2 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA10

Launch - 07-Jan-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 78 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1049.4, fairing 2.2-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°
Experimental darkening treatment on STARLINK-1130 (DARKSAT) satellite in order to further reduce the light reflection.

Nominal deployment to 278.55/291.36km/53° orbit
</div>]]></description>
