			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1489 Starlink_v1.0-L2 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 07-Jan-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 78 B1049.4 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

629km downrange (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/94647

MECO at 2234m/s, 1-3-1 engines19s entry burn, single engine 22s succesful landing burn.
7m from bullseye landing, secured by all arms of Octograbber. Two of landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
