		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2D93603298928667">
			<name>M1489 Starlink_v1.0-L2 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1489 Starlink_v1.0-L2 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Navigator MarineTraffic recovery position.

741km downrange

New Fairing 2.2-s (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion) without acoustic tiles.
First flight of fairing version 2.2. - lowered square protrusion.

GO Ms. Tree unsuccessful in catching the passive fairing half. Parafoil caught in the netting corner.
Active fairing half recovered intact from the water by GO Navigator.
</div>]]></description>
