			<name>M1501 Starlink_v1.0-L3 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1501 Starlink_v1.0-L3 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA10

Launch - 29-Jan-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 80 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1051.3, fairing 2.1-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Nominal deployment to 279.3/291.9km/53.01° orbit.
</div>]]></description>
