</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1501 Starlink_v1.0-L3 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 29-Jan-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 80 B1051.3 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

629km downrange (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/94653

MECO at 2244m/s, 1-3-1 engines19s entry burn, single engine ~27s succesful landing burn.
5m from bullseye landing, hard touch-down absorbed by all crush cores. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
