		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2DBCBA65259906DD">
			<name>M1501 Starlink_v1.0-L3 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1501 Starlink_v1.0-L3 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms. Chief MarineTraffic recovery position.

747km downrange

New Fairing 2.1-s (tip thermal protection) without acoustic tiles.

GO Ms. Tree caught active fairing half – as third successful catch!
Passive fairing half recovered from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
</div>]]></description>
