		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2E48D340BFBB40D3">
			<name>M1502 Starlink_v1.0-L4 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1502 Starlink_v1.0-L4 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA10

Launch - 17-Feb-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 81 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1056.4, fairing 2.2-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Deployment to 198.84/381.73km/53° direct inject elliptical orbit.
No stage2 deorbit burn. S2 conducted a passivation and reentered 05-Mar at 13:44 UTC over the NE Pacific.
</div>]]></description>
