		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2E67666DA09F7DA7">
			<name>M1502 Starlink_v1.0-L4 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1502 Starlink_v1.0-L4 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms. Chief MarineTraffic recovery position.

717km downrange

New fairing 2.2-s (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion) without acoustic tiles.

Damaged active fairing half fished out from the water by GO Ms.Tree - parachute got stuck on the net.
Damaged passive fairing half fished out from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0A6A2036232C6E063458</styleUrl>
