			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1408 CRS-20 launch groundtrack</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA10

Launch - 07-Mar-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 82 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1059.2

Total Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1509 kg
Trunk payload 468kg - Bartolomeo
Dragon C112.3 deployed into 211/391km/51.63° initial orbit
Stage2 inclination change maneuver to 47.8° together with deorbit burn on the first orbit.

@elonmusk 07 Mar 2020:
Final Dragon Version 1 mission tonight
</div>]]></description>
