		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2E964AF031356897">
			<name>M1408 CRS-20 LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1408 CRS-20 LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 07-Mar-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1059.2 Flight 82 - CCAFS LZ-1

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/97772

MECO at 1646m/s. 1-3-1 engines 45s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 21s entry burn, single engine 31s successful landing burn.
6m from bullseye landing.

SpaceX's 50th landing of a F9 booster!

@elonmusk 07 Mar 2020:
Rocket will land in highest winds ever at Cape Canaveral tonight. This is intentional envelope expansion.
Envelope expanded
</div>]]></description>
