		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2EB8E9652C34887C">
			<name>M1503 Starlink_v1.0-L5 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1503 Starlink_v1.0-L5 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA10

Launch - 18-Mar-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 83 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1048.5 - first 5th reflight of a F9, fairing 2.1-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°
The fairing previously flew on the Starlink-1 launch in May 2019

Planned nominal deployment to 217.25/373km/53° direct inject elliptical orbit.
Stage2 deorbit burn on the first orbit.

Engine failure at T+2:21.

@elonmusk 22 Apr 2020:
Small amount of isopropyl alcohol (cleaning fluid) was trapped in a sensor dead leg & ignited in flight
</div>]]></description>
