			<name>M1503 Starlink_v1.0-L5 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1503 Starlink_v1.0-L5 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Planned Landing - 18-Mar-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 83 B1048.5 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

627km downrange (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/97791

MECO at 2200m/s, 1-3-1 engines 21s entry burn
Booster landing failure.
@elonmusk 18 Mar 2020:
Elon: Yeah. There was also an early engine shutdown on ascent, but it didn’t affect orbit insertion. Shows value of having 9 engines! Thorough investigation needed before next missio
</div>]]></description>
