					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA11

Launch - 22-Apr-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 84 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1051.4, fairing 2.1-s.
The fairing previously flew on the Amos-17 launch in Aug 2019

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 220.3/374.2km/53° direct inject elliptical orbit.
Stage2 deorbit burn on the first orbit.
</SimpleData>
