</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms. Chief MarineTraffic recovery position.

711km downrange

Fairing 2.1-s (tip thermal protection) without acoustic tiles.
Both fairing halves previously flew on the Amos-17 launch in Aug 2019.

@SpaceX 17 Apr 2020:
The fairing previously supported launch of the AMOS-17 mission in August 2019

No fairing catch attempt as boat and fairing software software is undergoing upgrades. Water recovery by small scoop nets.
Intact active fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Ms.Tree.
Intact passive fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
</SimpleData>
