			<name>M1378 CCP-DM2 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1378 CCP-DM2 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA11

Launch - 30-May-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 85 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1058
First Manned Dragon 2 (Crew Dragon demo) mission
Crew: Doug Hurley, Commander / Bob Behnken, Pilot
Zero-G indicator apatosaurus "Tremor"

Dragon C206 ''Endeavour'' deployed into 197/218km/51.64° initial orbit

Elon Musk 31 May 2020: "The Trampoline is working!"
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
