			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1378 CCP-DM2 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 30-May-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1058 Flight 85 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

Hawk tug MarineTraffic recovery position.
509km downrange, from initially plannned position 18 km southeast

MECO at 1886m/s, 1-3-1 engines 34s entry burn, single engine ~30s successful landing burn.
9m from bullseye landing, secured by four arms of Octograbber. Landing legs stowed even on Octagrabber.
</div>]]></description>
