		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_30ADD28DBD0AC657">
			<name>M1514 Starlink_v1.0-L8 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1514 Starlink_v1.0-L8 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA11

Launch - 13-Jun-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 87 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1059.3, fairing 2.2/2.1-s.

Totally more than 15410kg payload. 58pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) and SkySats 16, 17, 18 (110 kg each).

Planned nominal deployment to 219.8/373.9km/53° direct inject elliptical orbit.
Stage2 deorbit burn on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
