			<name>M1514 Starlink_v1.0-L8 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1514 Starlink_v1.0-L8 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms. Chief MarineTraffic recovery position.

690km downrange

Fairing 2.2/2.1-s (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion of active half) without acoustic tiles.
Active fairing half previously flew on the Starlink_v1.0-L2 launch in Jan 2020.
Passive fairing half previously flew on the JCSat-18 launch in Dec 2019.

Intact active fairing half fished out from the water by GO Ms.Tree.
Intact passive fairing half fished out from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
</div>]]></description>
