		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3104423B0D993813">
			<name>M1423 GPS III SV03 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1423 GPS III SV03 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA11

Launch - 30-Jun-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 88 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1060.1, fairing 2.2.

Grey bend across RP1 part of the second stage that affect temperature of the fuel.
Stage 2 deorbit southwards of Cape Town between T+06h17m - T+07h33m.

Approx. 4400kg MEO satellite GPS III-SV03 (Matthew Henson, ex Columbus, NAVSTAR 79, USA 304)
Deployment into 394/20175km/55° orbit
</div>]]></description>
