			<name>M1423 GPS III SV03 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1423 GPS III SV03 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms. Chief MarineTraffic recovery position.

753km downrange

New fairing 2.2 (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion).

No fairing catch attempt. Water recovery by small scoop nets.
Intact active fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Ms.Tree.
Intact passive fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
</div>]]></description>
