		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_30E0419B36323A81">
			<name>M1515 Starlink_v1.0-L9 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1515 Starlink_v1.0-L9 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA11

Launch - 07-Aug-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 90 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1051.5, fairing 2.2-s.

Totally more than 14932kg payload. 57pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) and BlackSky Global 5 & 6 (56 kg each).
Sun shade blocks on Starlinks (VisorSat) in order to reduce the light reflection.

Planned nominal deployment to 388.2/401.4km/53.02° circular orbit.
Stage2 deorbit burn on the second orbit.
</div>]]></description>
