		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_31DAEE349FF0C024">
			<name>M1515 Starlink_v1.0-L9 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1515 Starlink_v1.0-L9 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms. Chief MarineTraffic recovery position.

715km downrange

New fairing 2.2-s (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion) without acoustic tiles.

Boats were unsuccessful in catching fairing halves.
Intact active fairing half fished out from the water by GO Ms.Tree.
Intact passive fairing half fished out from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
</div>]]></description>
