		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_31F929D9E6257662">
			<name>M1516 Starlink_v1.0-L10 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1516 Starlink_v1.0-L10 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA11

Launch - 18-Aug-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 91 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1049.6 - first 6th reflight of a F9, fairing 2.1-s.

Totally more than 15410kg payload. 58pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) and SkySats 19, 20, 21 (110 kg each).

Planned nominal deployment to 219.9/373.8km/53° direct inject elliptical orbit.
Stage2 deorbit burn on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
