</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 18-Aug-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 91 B1049.6 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Finn Falgout, Go Quest support

634km downrange (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/100590

MECO at 2201m/s, 1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn, single engine 20s landing burn.
2m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
