			<name>M1336 SAOCOM-1B launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1336 SAOCOM-1B launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.do/LHA11

Launch - 30-Aug-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 92 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1059.4, fairing 2.1.
SpaceX's first polar orbit from the east coast
3000kg satellite SAOCOM-1B (CONAE), Smallsat Rideshare Mission 1 (SSO): 39 kg GNOMES-1 (PlanetiQ), Tyvak-0172
Deployment to 612.8/630km/97.9° SSO orbit
</div>]]></description>
