			<name>M1518 Starlink_v1.0-L11 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1518 Starlink_v1.0-L11 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA11

Launch - 03-Sep-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 93 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1060.2, fairing 2.2-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 220.1/350.2km/53° direct inject elliptical orbit.
Stage2 deorbit burn on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
