		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_32878B48FAE85798">
			<name>M1517 Starlink_v1.0-L12 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1517 Starlink_v1.0-L12 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA12

Launch - 06-Oct-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 94 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1058.3, fairing 2.1/2.2-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 260.52/278.15km/53° circular orbit.
Planned Stage2 debris reentry on the second orbit south of Australia. Deorbit burn didn't performed. Uncontrolled reentry over Inner Mongolia at 14:01 UTC 30 Oct 2020.

@SpaceX 06 Oct 2020:
Once these satellites reach their target position, we will be able to roll out a fairly wide public beta in northern US & hopefully southern Canada. Other countries to follow as soon as we receive regulatory approval.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">M1517 Starlink_v1.0-L12 launch groundtrack
</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA12

Launch - 06-Oct-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 94 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1058.3, fairing 2.1/2.2-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 260.52/278.15km/53° circular orbit.
Planned Stage2 debris reentry on the second orbit south of Australia. Deorbit burn didn&apos;t performed. Uncontrolled reentry over Inner Mongolia at 14:01 UTC 30 Oct 2020.

@SpaceX 06 Oct 2020:
Once these satellites reach their target position, we will be able to roll out a fairly wide public beta in northern US &amp; hopefully southern Canada. Other countries to follow as soon as we receive regulatory approval.
</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
