		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_33114C93C94CA84B">
			<name>M1517 Starlink_v1.0-L12 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1517 Starlink_v1.0-L12 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms. Chief MarineTraffic recovery position.

725km downrange

Fairing 2.1/2.2-s (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion of passive half) without acoustic tiles.

First 3rd reflight of a fairing half. Active fairing half previously flew on Starlink_v0.9 and Starlink_v1.0-L5 missions.

Intact active fairing half captured to the net of GO Ms.Tree.
Intact passive fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0A6A2036232C6E063458</styleUrl>
