		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_330BAFB271CE8D37">
			<name>M1541 Starlink_v1.0-L13 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1541 Starlink_v1.0-L13 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA12

Launch - 18-Oct-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 95 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1051.6, fairing 2.2/2.1-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 261.6/277.8km/53.06° circular orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry on the second orbit south of Australia.
</div>]]></description>
