			<name>M1541 Starlink_v1.0-L13 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1541 Starlink_v1.0-L13 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 18-Oct-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 95 B1051.6 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Finn Falgout, Go Quest support

633km downrange (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/101733

1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn, single engine ~23s landing burn.
5m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
