707km downrange

Fairing 2.2/2.1-s (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion of active half) without acoustic tiles.

Third reflight of both fairing halves. Active half after Starl1-L2, Starl1-L8. Passive half after JCSat-18, Starl1-L8.

Active fairing half captured to the net of GO Ms.Tree. Corner of the net has been ruptured and fairing that came through the net.
Intact passive fairing half captured to the net of GO Ms.Chief.
Both fairing halves later transported from NC to the Cape by GO Ms.Tree
</SimpleData>
