		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3342CE692B688E18">
			<name>M1542 Starlink_v1.0-L14 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1542 Starlink_v1.0-L14 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA12

Launch - 24-Oct-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 96 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1060.3, fairing 2.2-s.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 263.4/277.2km/53.06° circular orbit.
Planned Stage2 debris reentry on the second orbit south of Australia. Deorbit burn didn't performed.
</div>]]></description>
