		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_33737777AFC47EF3">
			<name>M1542 Starlink_v1.0-L14 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1542 Starlink_v1.0-L14 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Big Stone Leader MarineTraffic located position.

684km downrange

New fairing 2.2-s (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion) without acoustic tiles.

Big Stone Leader in recovery area in order to locate the fairings. GO Ms.Chief reached position few hours later following repairs.
Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0A6A2036232C6E063458</styleUrl>
