			<name>M1457 GPS III SV04 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1457 GPS III SV04 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA12

Launch - 05-Nov-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 97 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1062.1, fairing 2.2.

Stage2 debris reentry south of South Africa at approx. 7hrs after launch.

Approx. 3880kg MEO satellite GPS III-SV04 (Sacagawea, NAVSTAR 77, USA 309).
Deployment into 409/20191km/55° orbit
</div>]]></description>
