		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_33C5B489DFA3D7BE">
			<name>M1401 CCP-01 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1401 CCP-01 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA12

Launch - 16-Nov-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 98 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1061.1

Crew: CDR - Michael Scott “Mike” Hopkins / PLT - Victor Jerome Glover / MS1 - Soichi Noguchi / MS2 - Shannon Walker
Approx. 240kg of pressurized cargo.
Zero-G indicator mascot "Baby Yoda"

Dragon C207 ''Resilience'' deployed into 196/216km/51.65° initial orbit

CCP manager Steve Stich - Resilience incorporates multiple improvement: heat shield; vent system; new solar arrays for 210 days in space; landing capability
@elonmusk 12 Nov 2020:
4 Astronauts fly to @Space_Station on Sat night from Cape. First operational flight of Crew Dragon.

Trunk reentry over Australia at 08 Jul 21:05 UTC.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
