		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3406C1F3085127EF">
			<name>M1401 CCP-01 real ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1401 CCP-01 real ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 16-Nov-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 98 B1061.1 - Marmac303 JRtI, Finn Falgout tug, Go Quest support

 Finn Falgout tug MarineTraffic recovery position.
560km downrange, from initially plannned position 24 km northeast


MECO at 1957m/s, 1-3-1 engines 28s entry burn, single engine successful landing burn.
Approx. 6° tilt and shifted to the stern of the port side after landing, secured by four arms of Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.

@elonmusk 19 Nov 2020:
Change out a few parts, otherwise fine
</div>]]></description>
