		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_33EABC178B38757C">
			<name>M1543 Starlink_v1.0-L15 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1543 Starlink_v1.0-L15 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA12

Launch - 25-Nov-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 100 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1049.7 - first 7th reflight of a F9, fairing 2.1/2.2-se.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 219.7/372.9km/53° direct inject elliptical orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry on the first orbit in Eastern Pacific.

@elonmusk 25 Nov 2020:
This is a life leader launch, so more risk than normal
</div>]]></description>
