		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_341139A58619E30E">
			<name>M1543 Starlink_v1.0-L15 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1543 Starlink_v1.0-L15 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms. Chief and GO Searcher MarineTraffic recovery position.

690km downrange

Fairing 2.1/2.2-se (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion of passive half) without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges.
First flight of fairing configuration e - vent holes at halves edges

Second reflight for passive fairing half (after Starl-L7), third reflight for active fairing half (after Amos-17,Starl1-L6).

Intact passive fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
Intact active fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Searcher.
</div>]]></description>
