		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_342BD7471CDCD586">
			<name>M1410 CRS-21 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1410 CRS-21 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA12

Launch - 06-Dec-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 101 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1058.4

Total Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1882 kg
Unpressurized Trunk payload - 1090kg - Bishop (NanoRacks Airlock Module)
Dragon C208 deployed into 199.5/218.7km/51.65° initial orbit.

First mission under the CRS-2 contract.

Dragon2 is designed for up to 5 flights, 20% more volume and double the powered lockers (from 6 to 12).
Modif.from crew vehicles - removed SuperDracos, removed two trunk fins used only for abort, seats and crew displays swapped for cargo racks, environmental control systems reduced in size and complexity
</div>]]></description>
