</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 06-Dec-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 101 B1058.4 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

623km downrange (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/102802

MECO at 2157m/s, 1-3-1 engines 30s entry burn, single engine ~27s landing burn.
Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed on Octagrabber.
