Two NRO reconnaissance satellites USA-312 and USA-313, within launch code name NROL-108.
Deployment to 525.8/545.9km/51.35° orbit.

@elonmusk 17 Dec 2020:
Last launch of 2020 coming up
</div>]]></description>
