		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_350E2970AFE6EA88">
			<name>M1544 Starlink_v1.0-L16 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1544 Starlink_v1.0-L16 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA13

Launch - 20-Jan-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 105 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1051.8 - first 8th reflight of booster, fairing 2.1-set - first fairing 2.1 without tip thermal protection.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 258/284.4km/53° circular orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry on the second orbit south of Australia.
</div>]]></description>
