		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_350E2A59BF5DA194">
			<name>M1544 Starlink_v1.0-L16 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1544 Starlink_v1.0-L16 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 20-Jan-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 105 B1051.8 - Marmac303 JRtI, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

633km downrange (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/104255

Landing in a higher than usual wind condition - envelope expansion on stage1 landing wind performance.
MECO at 2212m/s, 1-3-1 engines 20s entry burn, single engine ~24s landing burn.
7m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed on Octagrabber.
</div>]]></description>
