		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_35345E909B908864">
			<name>M1544 Starlink_v1.0-L16 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1544 Starlink_v1.0-L16 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms.Chief MarineTraffic recovery position.

705km downrange

Fairing 2.1-set - without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges, no tip thermal protection.
Flight proven fairing halves.
Second reflight for active fairing half (after SAOCOM-1B).
Third reflight for passive fairing half (after Starlink_v1.0-L3 and Starlink_v1.0-L10).

Planned wet recovery by both Ms. Tree and Ms. Chief - retrieving from the water.
Fairing wasn't recovered (strong wind condition).
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0A6A2036232C6E063458</styleUrl>
