		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_358266F6B9CA5BB8">
			<name>SRFM1-1 Starlink_v1.0-L18 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM1-1 Starlink_v1.0-L18 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing -04-Feb-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 107 B1060.5 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Lauren Foss tug, Go Quest support

617km downrange (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/104482

MECO at 2210m/s, apogee 115km, 1-3-1 engines 20s entry burn at alt 54-35km, reentry at 1600m/s, single engine 25s successful landing burn from 2km alt..
5m from bullseye landing. Secured by Octograbber (by three of the four arms only). Landing legs stowed.
.

@elonmusk 04 Feb 2021:
This was a tough one
High seas & wind
</div>]]></description>
