		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_358267E4806870F1">
			<name>SRFM1-1 Starlink_v1.0-L18 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM1-1 Starlink_v1.0-L18 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Ms.Tree and GO Ms. Chief MarineTraffic recovery position.

684km downrange

Fairing 2.2/2.1-set (lowered square protrusion of active half) without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges, no tip thermal protection.

Second reflight for active fairing half (after GPS III SV03). Second reflight for passive fairing half (after SAOCOM-1B).
Planned wet recovery.
Intact active fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Ms.Tree
Intact passive fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Ms.Chief.
</div>]]></description>
