		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_353CFF3F10636F90">
			<name>M1545 Starlink_v1.0-L17 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1545 Starlink_v1.0-L17 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA13

Launch - 04-Mar-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 109 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1049.8, fairing 2.1/2.2-set.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 255.1/286.8km/53° circular orbit.
Planned Stage2 debris reentry on the second orbit south of Australia. Deorbit burn didn't performed.
S2 decayed 26 Mar 2021 ~04:00 UTC over Oregon and Washington. One COPV found on private property near Beverly, WA. Other COPV found at Alsea Bay, near Waldport, OR.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">M1545 Starlink_v1.0-L17 launch groundtrack
</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA13

Launch - 04-Mar-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 109 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1049.8, fairing 2.1/2.2-set.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 255.1/286.8km/53° circular orbit.
Planned Stage2 debris reentry on the second orbit south of Australia. Deorbit burn didn&apos;t performed.
S2 decayed 26 Mar 2021 ~04:00 UTC over Oregon and Washington. One COPV found on private property near Beverly, WA. Other COPV found at Alsea Bay, near Waldport, OR.
</SimpleData>
