			<name>M1545 Starlink_v1.0-L17 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1545 Starlink_v1.0-L17 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 04-Mar-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 109 B1049.8 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

604km downrange (30km closer then initially planned position with radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/104262

MECO at 2194m/s, apogee 118km, 1-3-1 engines 21s entry burn at alt 56-36km, reentry at 1534m/s, single engine 25s successful landing burn from 2km alt..
2m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
