			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM4-1 Starlink_v1.0-L21 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 14-Mar-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 111 B1051.9 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Hawk tug, Go Quest support

614km downrange (19km closer then initially planned position with radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/104485

MECO at 2203m/s, apogee 115km, 1-3-1 engines 18s entry burn at alt 54-38km, reentry at 1648m/s, single engine 24s successful landing burn from 2km alt..
5m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
