		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_36460BE3DA2B64D0">
			<name>SRFM4-1 Starlink_v1.0-L21 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM4-1 Starlink_v1.0-L21 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Searcher and GO Navigator MarineTraffic recovery positions.

680km downrange

Fairing 2.2-se (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion) without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges.

Spx: Falcon 9’s fairing previously flew on the Transporter-1 mission.

Second reflight for both active and passive fairing halves (after Transporter-1).

Intact passive fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Searcher
Intact active fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Navigator
</div>]]></description>
