</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM5-1 Starlink_v1.0-L22 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA13

Launch - 24-Mar-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 112 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster 1060.6, fairing 2.2-set.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 258/284.5km/53° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in South Pacific.
</div>]]></description>
