			<name>M1402 CCP-02 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1402 CCP-02 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA14

Launch - 23-Apr-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 114 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1061.2

Crew: CDR - Robert Shane Kimbrough / PLT - Katherine Megan McArthur / MS1 - Akihiko Hoshide / MS2 - Thomas Gautier Pesquet
More than 227kg of pressurized cargo.
Zero-G indicator "Guinguin the penguin"

Dragon C206.2 ''Endeavour'' deployed into 197.3/220.5km/51.64° initial orbit.
Stage2 Debris Reentry in Indian Ocean on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
