			<name>M1402 CCP-02 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1402 CCP-02 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 23-Apr-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 98 B1061.2 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Finn Falgout tug, Go Quest support

Finn Falgout tug MarineTraffic recovery position.
546km downrange (4km farther then then initially planned position with radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/105668

MECO at 1944m/s, 1-3-1 engines 27s entry burn, single engine ~32s successful landing burn.
1m from bullseye landing. Secured by Octograbber (by three of the four arms only). Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
