		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_374FC63045FFDF12">
			<name>SRFM2-2 Starlink_v1.0-L25 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM2-2 Starlink_v1.0-L25 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Shelia Bordelon MarineTraffic recovery position.

680km downrange

Fairing 2.1-set/2.2-se (tip thermal protection on passive half, lowered square protrusion of passive half) without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges, no tip thermal protection on active half.

Spx: One half of Falcon 9’s fairing previously supported two Starlink missions.

Third reflight for active fairing half (after Starl1-L3 and Starl1-L10).
Brand new passive fairing half.

Intact passive fairing half scooped out from the water by Shelia Bordelon
</div>]]></description>
