			<name>SRFM5-2 Starlink_v1.0-L28 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM5-2 Starlink_v1.0-L28 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA14

Launch - 26-May -21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 119 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster 1063.2, Fairing 2.1/2.2-set.

Totally more than 15600kg payload. 60pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.0 satellites (260 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53°

Planned nominal deployment to 259.7/282.4km/53° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit south of Australia.
</div>]]></description>
