			<name>SRFM5-2 Starlink_v1.0-L28 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM5-2 Starlink_v1.0-L28 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 26-May-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 119 B1063.2 - Marmac303 JRtI, Finn Falgout tug, Go Quest support

MarineTraffic recovery position 624km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/105207 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2196m/s, apogee 123km, 1-3-1 engines 18s entry burn at alt 56-38km, reentry at 1640m/s, single engine ~27s successful landing burn.
10m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
