		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_37EABB019A5E99CF">
			<name>M1411 CRS-22 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1411 CRS-22 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA14

Launch - 03-Jun-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 120 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1067.1

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 1948 kg
Unpressurized Trunk payload 1380 kg - 2x iROSA (ISS Roll-Out Solar Arrays)
Reused DM-2 heatshield backshell - first Dragon's heatshield reuse.
Dragon C209.1 deployed into 199.8/218.9km/51.64° initial orbit

Stage2 debris reentry south of Australia on the first orbit.
S2 debris object released in orbit 216.6/552.5km/51.72° and rapidly decaying.
</div>]]></description>
