			<name>M1441 SXM-8 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1441 SXM-8 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 06-Jun-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 121 B1061.3 - Marmac303 JRtI, Finn Falgout tug, Go Quest support

MarineTraffic recovery position 655km downrange.

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/106540 (with radius of operation within 75km).

MECO at 2265m/s, apogee 123km, 1-3-1 engines 21s entry burn at alt 59-40km, reentry at 1628m/s, single engine 28s successful landing burn from 2.4km alt.
3m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed on Octagrabber.
</div>]]></description>
