		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_37F94865A17C62E4">
			<name>M1441 SXM-8 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1441 SXM-8 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: GO Searcher and GO Navigator water recovery.

MarineTraffic recovery position 762km downrange

New fairing 2.3-s (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion, next edge vent on raised position) without acoustic tiles.

Fairing halves are taking flight for the first time

Intact active fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Searcher
Intact passive fairing half scooped out from the water by GO Navigator
</div>]]></description>
