			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1573 Transporter-2 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA14

Launch - 30-Jun-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 123 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster 1060.8, fairing 2.2/2.1-se

Transporter-2 SmallSat Rideshare payload with 85 spacecraft (including CubeSats, microsats, and orbital transfer vehicles) and 3 Starlink satellites

Deployment into approx. 529/543km/97.5° SSO orbit
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in area north of Kerguelen Islands.
</div>]]></description>
