			<name>M1573 Transporter-2 LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1573 Transporter-2 LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 30-Jun-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1060.8 Flight 123 - CCAFS LZ-1

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/107198

MECO at 1650m/s, 1-3-1 engines 43s boostback burn, apogee 141km, 1-3-1 engines 22s entry burn at alt 54-31km, reentry at 758m/s, single engine 33s successful landing burn from 4.8km alt..
</div>]]></description>
