MarineTraffic recovery position 592km downrange

Fairing 2.2/2.1-se (tip thermal protection, lowered square protrusion of active half) without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges.

Third flight for active fairing half (after Transporter-1 and Starlink_v1-L21).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after SAOCOM-1B and Starlink_v1-L18).

Planned wet recovery.
Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by Hos Briarwood.
