			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1412 CRS-23 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA15

Launch - 29-Aug-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 124 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1061.4

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging - 2207 kg

First reuse of cargo Dragon 2.
Dragon C208.2 deployed into 214.5/245.6km/51.65° initial orbit

Stage2 debris reentry south of Australia on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
