Fairing 2.2-se (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

Spx: One half of Falcon 9’s fairing halves previously supported NROL-108 and the other previously flew on GPS III-3 and Turksat-5A.

Second flight for active fairing half (after NROL-108).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after Turksat-5A and GPS III-3).

Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by NRC Quest
