		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3A0060E39889D42C">
			<name>M1633 Inspiration4 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1633 Inspiration4 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA15

Launch - 16-Sep-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 126 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1062.3
Crew: CDR - Jared Isaacman, "Leadership", "Rook" / PLT - Dr. Sian Proctor , "Prosperity", "Leo" / MS1 - Chris Sembroski , "Generosity" , "Hanks"/ MS2 - Hayley Arceneaux, "Hope", "Nova"
Zero-G indicator "Golden Retriever assistance dog".

First commercial mission of CrewDragon. First flight with Dragon’s Cupola.
Dragon C207.2 deployed into 576.8/586.5km/51.64° initial orbit.
Three days on circular orbit of 585km - a new Dragon altitude record.

Stage2 debris reentry on the first orbit to the Area in South Pacific.

@elonmusk 21 Sep 2021:
Yeah, a little oven for heating food & Starlink wifi
Definitely upgraded toilets :) We had some challenges with it this flight.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
