		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3A0061C5A2A09D82">
			<name>M1633 Inspiration4 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1633 Inspiration4 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 16-Sep-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 126 B1062.3 - Marmac303 JRtI, Finn Falgout tug, Doug support

MarineTraffic recovery position 553km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/108500 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 1966m/s, apogee 170km, 1-3-1 engines 25s entry burn at alt 68-39km, reentry at 1270m/s, single engine 31s successful landing burn from 3km alt.

2m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed on Octagrabber.
</div>]]></description>
