</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1461 CCP-03 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA15

Launch - 11-Nov-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 127 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1067.2

Crew: CDR - Raja Chari / PLT - Thomas H. Marshburn / MS1 - Kayla Barron / MS2 - Matthias Maurer

Reused nosecone - first Dragon's nosecone reuse.
Zero-G indicator plushy turtle.

Dragon C210.1 ''Endurance'' deployed into 196.9/219.6km/51.64° initial orbit.
Stage2 Debris Reentry in Indian Ocean on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
