			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM6-2 Starlink_G4-1 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA15

Launch - 13-Nov -21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 128 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster 1058.9, Fairing 2.2-se.

Totally 16250kg payload. 53pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each) on target orbit approx. 550/550km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 218.9/346.4km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry east of New Zealand on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
