			<name>SRFM6-2 Starlink_G4-1 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM6-2 Starlink_G4-1 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 13-Nov-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 128 B1058.9 - Marmac303 JRtI, Bob tug/support, Finn Falgout tug

MarineTraffic recovery position 635km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/104965 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2184m/s, apogee 128km, 1-3-1 engines 20s entry burn at alt 55-36km, reentry at 1594m/s, single engine ~27s successful landing burn.
3m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
