		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3B2EA7B32BC51709">
			<name>SRFM6-2 Starlink_G4-1 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM6-2 Starlink_G4-1 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery positions.

MarineTraffic recovery position 668km downrange

Fairing 2.2-se (lowered square protrusion of passive half) without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges.

Spx: One half of Falcon 9's fairing previously supported the GPS III-4 mission and a Starlink mission, and the other previously supported another Starlink mission.

Third flight for active fairing half (after GPS III SV04 and Starlink_v1-L27).
Second flight for passive fairing half (after Starlink_v1-L25).
</div>]]></description>
