			<name>SRFM1-8 Starlink_G4-4 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM1-8 Starlink_G4-4 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA15

Launch - 18-Dec-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 132 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1051.11 - first 11th reflight of booster, Fairing 2.2-set.

Totally 15943kg payload. 52pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°.

Planned nominal deployment to 210.7/341.1km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry reentry in North Pacific.
</div>]]></description>
