			<name>SRFM1-8 Starlink_G4-4 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SRFM1-8 Starlink_G4-4 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: NRC Quest water recovery.

MarineTraffic recovery position 646km downrange

Fairing 2.2-set (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges, no tip thermal protection).

Spx: ...third flight for one of those halves and the fourth flight for the other

Third flight for active fairing half (after Sentinel-6 MF and Starlink_v1-L20).
Fourth flight for passive fairing half (after Anasis II ,SXM-7 and Starl1-L20).
</div>]]></description>
