			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1413 CRS-24 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA16

Launch - 21-Dec-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 134 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1069.1

Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging 2081 kg
Unpressurized Trunk payload 908 kg - COWVR, TEMPEST
Dragon C209.2 deployed into 212.3/362.7km/51.64° initial orbit

Stage2 debris reentry south of Australia on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
