			<name>M1413 CRS-24 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1413 CRS-24 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 21-Dec-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 134 B1069.1 - Marmac303 JRtI, Doug tug/support

MarineTraffic recovery position 615km downrange
FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/111025x (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2170m/s, apogee 127km, 1-3-1 engines 28s entry burn at alt 62-37km, reentry at 1287m/s, single engine 30s successful landing burn from 2.5km alt.
9m from bullseye landing.
Approx. 2° tilt and shifted to the stern of the port side after landing, lying on engine bells, secured by chains only to damaged Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
