		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3C4966C7237D4CAE">
			<name>M1717 Starlink_G4-5 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1717 Starlink_G4-5 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA16

Launch - 06-Jan -22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 135 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1062.4, Fairing 2.1./2.2.-set

Totally 15023kg payload. 49pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°.

Planned nominal deployment to 217.2/346.0km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in South Atlantic.

@elonmusk 07 Jan 2022:
Starlinks with “lasers” deployed to orbit
</div>]]></description>
