			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1717 Starlink_G4-5 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 645km downrange

Fairing 2.1./2.2.-set (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges, no tip thermal protection).

Spx: One half flying for the fifth time and the other for a fourth time.

Fifth reflight for active fairing half (after Amos-17,Starl1-L6, Starl1-L15 and Starl1-L23).
Fourth flight for passive fairing half (after Starl1-L7 ,Starl1-15 and Starl1-L17).

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
