			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1574 Transporter-3 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA16

Launch - 13-Jan-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 136 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster 1058.10, new fairing 2.3-s

Transporter-3 SmallSat Rideshare payload with 105 spacecraft (including CubeSats, microsats, and orbital transfer vehicles).

Deployment into approx. 529.8/544.1km/97.5° SSO orbit
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Indian Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
