		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3C6CCFAD4F675846">
			<name>M1574 Transporter-3 LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1574 Transporter-3 LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 13-Jan-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1058.10 Flight 136 - CCAFS LZ-1

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/112327

MECO at 1654m/s, 1-3-1 engines 46s boostback burn, apogee 141km, 1-3-1 engines 23s entry burn at alt 55-32km, reentry at 765m/s, single engine 33s successful landing burn from 4km alt..
~1m from bullseye landing.
</div>]]></description>
