			<name>M1718 Starlink_G4-6 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1718 Starlink_G4-6 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 19-Jan-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 137 B1060.10 - Marmac302 ASoG, Zion M Falgout tug, Doug support

MarineTraffic recovery position 640km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/111915 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2191m/s, apogee 132km, 1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn at alt 57-38km, reentry at 1618m/s, single engine 26s successful landing burn from 2km alt.
2m from bullseye landing. Secured by three arms of Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
