					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA16

Launch - 31-Jan-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 138 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster 1052.3, fairing 2.2./2.1-e

2205kg synthetic aperture radar satellite COSMO-SkyMed Second Generation 2.

Deployment into 626.6/632.9km/97.89° SSO orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in South Pacific.
</SimpleData>
