		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3CC7D7726F6789AC">
			<name>M1709 CSG-2 LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1709 CSG-2 LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 31-Jan-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1052.3 Flight 138 - CCAFS LZ-1

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/111326

MECO at 1663m/s, 1-3-1 engines 48s boostback burn, apogee 129km, 1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn at alt 53-34km, reentry at 822m/s, single engine 34s successful landing burn from 4km alt.
Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
