		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3CC7D82EDF632485">
			<name>M1709 CSG-2 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1709 CSG-2 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 615km downrange

Fairing 2.2./2.1-e
Fourth flight for both fairing halves.

Spx: "One half of the fairings supporting this mission previously supported Transporter-1, Transporter-2, and one Starlink mission, and the other half previously supported SAOCOM 1B, Transporter-2, and one Starlink mission.".

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Bob.
</div>]]></description>
