			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1494 NROL-87 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA16

Launch - 02-Feb-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 139 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1071.1, new fairing 2.3.

NRO reconnaissance satellites USA-326, within launch code name NROL-87.
Deployment to 498.8/531.3km/97.9° orbit.

S2 debris reentry in northeastern Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
