			<name>M1719 Starlink_G4-7 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1719 Starlink_G4-7 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA16

Launch - 03-Feb-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 140 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1061.6, Fairing 2.1/2.2-se

Totally 15023kg payload. 49pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°.

Planned nominal deployment to 216.9/345.4km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in South Atlantic.
</div>]]></description>
