		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3CD7B6085B3CD74E">
			<name>M1719 Starlink_G4-7 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1719 Starlink_G4-7 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 642km downrange

Fairing 2.1./2.2.-se (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

Spx: One fairing half previously supported five Starlink missions, and the other half previously supported Transporter-1 and two Starlink missions.

Sixth flight for active fairing half (after Starlink-1 v0.9, Star1-L5, Star1-L12, Star1-L17, Star1-L28).
Fourth flight for passive fairing half (after Transporter-1, Star1-L21 and Star1-L28).

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
