			<name>M1720 Starlink_G4-8 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1720 Starlink_G4-8 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA16

Launch - 21-Feb-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 141 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1058.11, Fairing 2.2-se

Totally 14104kg payload. 46pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°.

Planned nominal deployment to 332.6/343.8km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in South Atlantic.
</div>]]></description>
