			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1723 Starlink_G4-11 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: NRC Quest water recovery.

MarineTraffic recovery position 654km downrange

Fairing 2.2-set (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges, no tip thermal protection).

Spx webcast: Both fairing halves on today's Falcon 9 rocket are flying for the third time

Third flight for active fairing half (after NROL-108 and Starlink_G2-1).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after Sentinel-6 MF and Starlink_v1-L22).
</div>]]></description>
