			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1722 Starlink_G4-9 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA16

Launch - 03-Mar-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 143 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1060.11, Fairing 2.2-se

Totally 14410kg payload. 47pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°.

Planned nominal deployment to 312.2/323.8km/53.21° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in South Atlantic.
</div>]]></description>
