			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1724 Starlink_G4-12 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA17

Launch - 19-Mar-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 145 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1051.12 - first 12th reflight of booster, Fairing 2.2/2.3-se

Totally 16250kg payload. 53pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 311.1/324.1km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit south of Australia.

@elonmusk 19 Mar 2022:
Also the heaviest Falcon 9 payload at 16.25 metric tons
</div>]]></description>
