		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3DB4B3922E8CE7EF">
			<name>M1724 Starlink_G4-12 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1724 Starlink_G4-12 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 19-Mar-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 145 B1051.12 - Marmac303 JRtI, Zion M Falgout tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 629km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/112971 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2229m/s, apogee 118km, 1-3-1 engines 18s entry burn at alt 62-46km, reentry at 1672m/s, single engine 23s successful landing burn from 1.9km alt.
7m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
