		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3DB4B3F4EEB7E510">
			<name>M1724 Starlink_G4-12 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1724 Starlink_G4-12 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 648km downrange

Fairing 2.2/2.3-se (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

SpX webcast: one of the fairing halves on tonights mission is flying for the fourth time and the other for second time

Fourth flight for active fairing half (after GPS III SV04, Starlink_v1-L27 and Starlink_G4-1).
Second flight for passive fairing half (after SXM-8).
</div>]]></description>
