			<name>M1690 Transporter-4 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1690 Transporter-4 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA17

Launch - 01-Apr-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 146 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster 1061.7, new fairing 2.3-s

Transporter-4 SmallSat Rideshare payload with 40 spacecraft (including cubesats, microsats, picosats, hosted payloads, and an orbital transfer vehicle).

Deployment into 499/517km/97.4° to 646/633km/97.9° SSO orbit
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Indian Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
