		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3E1DCB0208C8D4D6">
			<name>M1579 AX-1 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1579 AX-1 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA17

Launch - 08-Apr-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 147 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1062.5

First Axiom Space contracted human spaceflight mission. First private crew to ISS.
Crew: CDR - Michael López-Alegría / PLT - Larry Conor / MS1 - Mark Pathy / MS2 - Eytan Stibbe
Zero-G indicator Caramel the Dog.

Dragon C206.3 ''Endeavour'' deployed into 214.4/259.1km/51.64° initial orbit.
Stage2 Debris Reentry in Indian Ocean on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
