			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1579 AX-1 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 08-Apr-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 147 B1062.5 - Marmac302 ASoG, Doug tug/support

Marmac302 MarineTraffic recovery position 538km downrange.

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/112353 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 1937m/s, apogee 167km, 1-3-1 engines 28s entry burn at alt 69-38km, reentry at 1143m/s, single engine 29s successful landing burn from 2.8km alt.
8m from bullseye landing. Landing legs stowed on Octagrabber.
</div>]]></description>
