			<name>M1523 NROL-85 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1523 NROL-85 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA17

Launch - 17-Apr-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 148 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1071.2, new fairing 2.3.

Approx. 6500 kg NOSS-3 (Naval Ocean Surveillance System) satellites Intruder 13A (NOSS-3 9A, USA 327) and Intruder 13B (NOSS-3 9B, USA 327-2).
Deployment to 1007/1206km/63.4° orbit.

Stage2 debris reentry in south Pacific on the second orbit.
</div>]]></description>
