</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1738 Starlink_G4-13 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA17

Launch - 12-May-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 153 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1063.5, Fairing 2.2-set.

Totally 16250kg payload. 53pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°.

Planned nominal deployment to 313.1/322.5km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in eastern Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
