		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3EDF94B9D45F606F">
			<name>M1738 Starlink_G4-13 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1738 Starlink_G4-13 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 12-May-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 153 B1063.5 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Debra C tug, Go Quest support

MarineTraffic recovery position 644km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/114558 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2248m/s, apogee 123km, 1-3-1 engines 17s entry burn at alt 62-46km, reentry at 1703m/s, single engine ~25s successful landing burn.
7m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
