					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA18

Launch - 18-May-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 155 - KSC LC-39A

Booster B1052.5, Fairing 2.3-s.

Totally 16250kg payload. 53pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 311.3/324.8km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit south of Australia.
</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
