			<name>M1780 Starlink_G4-18 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1780 Starlink_G4-18 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 18-May-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 155 B1052.5 - Marmac302 ASoG, Doug tug/support

MarineTraffic recovery position 625km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/114855 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2231m/s, apogee 116km, 1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn at alt 60-43km, reentry at 1664m/s, single engine 26s successful landing burn from 2.1km alt.
1m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
