		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3EEEA2C9285B2E35">
			<name>M1780 Starlink_G4-18 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1780 Starlink_G4-18 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 623km downrange

Fairing Fairing 2.3-s. (without acoustic tiles).

Third flight for active fairing half (after Starl1-L24 and Starlink_G4-6).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after Starl1-L24 and Starlink_G4-6).

SpX webcast: "both the fairing halves protecting our Starlink satellites today will be flying for the third time on this mission"

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
