			<name>M1636 Transporter-5 LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1636 Transporter-5 LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 25-May-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1061.8 Flight 156 - CCAFS LZ-1

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/114860

MECO at 1653m/s, 1-3-1 engines 46s boostback burn, apogee 146km, 1-3-1 engines 25s entry burn at alt 56-31km, reentry at 718m/s, single engine 35s successful landing burn from 4.4km alt.
Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
