		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3F897D90FD1B3C37">
			<name>M1781 Starlink_G4-19 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1781 Starlink_G4-19 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA18

Launch - 17-Jun-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 158 - KSC LC-39A

Booster B1060.13 - first 13th reflight of booster, Fairing 2.3-s.

Totally 16250kg payload. 53pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 239.1/344.2km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in eastern Pacific on the first orbit..
</div>]]></description>
