</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1781 Starlink_G4-19 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 640km downrange

Fairing 2.3-s. (without acoustic tiles).

Third flight for active fairing half (after IXPE and Starlink_G4-14).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after IXPE and Starlink_G4-14).

Active fairing half scooped out from the water by Bob.
Passive fairing half scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
