		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3F8FAE5A46BEBDD5">
			<name>M1575 Globalstar FM15 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1575 Globalstar FM15 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA18

Launch - 19-Jun-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 160 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster 1061.9, fairing 2.2-e.

~700kg satellite Globalstar FM15 (Globalstar-2 87) with US Government payloads.
Four secret US Government (Starlink-style) payloads USA 328, USA 329, USA 330 and USA 331 deployment to approx. 541/543km/52° orbit.
 Globalstar FM15 deployment to 1118.5/1132.5km/52° orbit.

Stage2 debris reentry in Pacific Ocean on the second orbit.
</div>]]></description>
