			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1575 Globalstar FM15 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 19-Jun-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 160 B1061.9 - Marmac303 JRtI, Finn Falgout tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 647km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/115185 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2142m/s, apogee 200km, 1-3-1 engines 24s entry burn at alt 69-37km, reentry at 1459m/s, single engine 28s successful landing burn from 2.5km alt.
6m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
