			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1575 Globalstar FM15 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 686km downrange

Fairing 2.2-e.

Fourth flight for active fairing half (after Starlink_v1-L9, Starlink_v1-L22 and Starlink_G4-9).
Fourth flight for passive fairing half (after Starlink_v1-L25, Starlink_G4-1 and Starlink_G4-17).

Both intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Bob.
</div>]]></description>
