			<name>M1783 Starlink_G4-21 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1783 Starlink_G4-21 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 07-Jul-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 161 B1058.13 - Marmac303 JRtI, Kurt J Crosby tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 648km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/115966 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2222m/s, apogee 134km, 1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn at alt 57-37km, reentry at 1651m/s, single engine ~25s successful landing burn from 2.0km alt.
Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
