		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_40187491FD789B71">
			<name>M1783 Starlink_G4-21 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1783 Starlink_G4-21 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 659km downrange

Fairing 2.3-s (without acoustic tiles).

Third flight for active fairing half (after Starlink_G4-3 and Starlink_G4-16).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after Starlink_G4-3 and Starlink_G4-16).

SpX webcast: "As you can see the fairings have deployed, marking the third flight for those fairing halves."

Intact active fairing half scooped out from the water by Bob.
</div>]]></description>
