			<name>M1603 Starlink_G3-1 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1603 Starlink_G3-1 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA18

Launch - 11-Jul-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 163 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1063.6, Fairing 2.3-s.

Totally 16250kg payload. 46pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/97.6°.

Planned nominal deployment to 314.6/327.4km/97.66° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in southern Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
