			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1784 Starlink_G4-22 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA19

Launch - 17-Jul-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 165 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1051.13, Fairing 2.3-s.

Totally 16250kg payload. 53pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 239.1/344.7km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in eastern Pacific on the first orbit..
</div>]]></description>
