		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_4025C65A00750539">
			<name>M1784 Starlink_G4-22 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1784 Starlink_G4-22 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 17-Jul-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 165 B1051.13 - Marmac303 JRtI, Kurt J Crosby tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 652km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/116049 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2224m/s, apogee 135km, 1-3-1 engines 17s entry burn at alt 57-38km, reentry at 1684m/s, single engine 24s successful landing burn from 2.0km alt.
6m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
