		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_4025C6F1E5DCDC5E">
			<name>M1784 Starlink_G4-22 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1784 Starlink_G4-22 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 652km downrange

Fairing 2.3-s. (without acoustic tiles).

Third flight for active fairing half (after NROL-87 and Starlink_G4-15).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after NROL-87 and Starlink_G4-15).

SpX webcast: "Today's flight marks the third for these fairing halves."

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Bob.
</div>]]></description>
