			<name>M1787 Starlink_G4-25 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1787 Starlink_G4-25 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA19

Launch - 24-Jul-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 167 - KSC LC-39A

Booster B1062.8, Fairing 2.1-se.

Totally 16250kg payload. 53pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 239.1/345.1km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in eastern Pacific on the first orbit..

Seventh flight for active fairing half (after Amos-17,Starl1-L6, Starl1-L15, Starl1-L23, Starlink_G4-5 and Starlink_G4-17).
Fifth flight for passive fairing half (after SAOCOM-1B, Starlink_v1-L18, Transporter-2 and CSG-2).

No fairing recovery.
</div>]]></description>
