		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_4080990702385B50">
			<name>M1481 KPLO fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1481 KPLO fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 717km downrange

Fairing 2.3.

Fourth flight for active fairing half (after Starlink_G4-3, Starlink_G4-16 and Starlink_G4-21).
Fourth flight for passive fairing half (after Starlink_v1-L24, Starlink_G4-6 and Starlink_G4-18).

SpX webcast: "those are the fourth flight for both these fairing halves"

Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by Bob.
</div>]]></description>
