		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_409F2D513A8AC229">
			<name>M1788 Starlink_G4-26 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1788 Starlink_G4-26 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA19

Launch - 09-Aug-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 169 - KSC LC-39A

Booster B1073.3, Fairing 2.3-s.

Totally 16250kg payload. 52pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 239.1/342.4km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in eastern Pacific on the first orbit..
</div>]]></description>
