			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1788 Starlink_G4-26 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 632km downrange

Fairing 2.3-s (without acoustic tiles).

Third flight for active fairing half (after Transporter-3 and SES-22).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after Transporter-3 and SES-22).

"SpX webcast: ""...third flight for each of the fairing halves	"""

