</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1789 Starlink_G4-27 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 672km downrange

Fairing 2.2-se (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

Fifth flight for active fairing half (after Sentinel-6 MF, Starlink_v1-L20, Starlink_G4-4 and Starlink_G4-13).
Sixth flight for passive fairing half (after Anasis II ,SXM-7, Starl1-L20, Starlink_G4-4 and Starlink_G4-13).

SpX webcast: "These fairings are marking the six flight and fifth flight respectively."

Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
