</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1785 Starlink_G4-23 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 664km downrange

Fairing 2.3-s (without acoustic tiles).

Third flight for active fairing half (after Starlink_G4-10 and Transporter-5).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after Starlink_G4-10 and Transporter-5).

SpX webcast: "Today marks the third flight for both fairing halves"

Intact active fairing half scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
