Booster B1052.7, Fairing 2.2.-se/2.3-s.

Totally 15630kg payload. 50pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (309 kg each) on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2° and Sherpa-LTC2 OTV with Varuna-TDM (Varuna Technology Demonstration Mission) (180 kg), on target orbit approx. 1056/1056km/54°

Planned nominal deployment to 310.9/323.3km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry south of Australia on the second orbit.
</div>]]></description>
