					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 648km downrange

Fairing 2.3-s (without acoustic tiles).

Fourth flight for active fairing half (after NROL-87, Starlink_G4-15 and Starlink_G4-22).
Third flight for passive fairing half (after GPS III SV05 and Turksat-5B).

SpX webcast: &quot;Today marks the third flight of one of these fairing half and fourth flight for the other.&quot;

Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by Bob.
</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
