			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1830 Starlink_G4-35 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA20

Launch - 24-Sep-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 177 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1073.4, Fairing 2.3-s/2.2-se.

Totally 16068kg payload. 52pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (309 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 239.2/343.8km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in eastern Pacific on the first orbit..
</div>]]></description>
