			<name>M1830 Starlink_G4-35 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1830 Starlink_G4-35 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 24-Sep-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 177 B1073.4 - Marmac302 ASoG, Bob tug/support

MarineTraffic recovery position 628km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/117798 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2188m/s, apogee 139km, 1-3-1 engines 22s entry burn at alt 67-46km, reentry at 1522m/s, single engine 24s successful landing burn from 2.0km alt.
4m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
