			<name>M1463 CCP-05 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1463 CCP-05 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA20

Launch - 05-Oct-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 178 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1077.1

Crew: CDR - Nicole Aunapu Mann (NASA) / PLT - Josh Cassada (NASA) / MS1 - Koichi Wakata (JAXA) / MS2 - Anna Kikina (Roscosmos)

Zero-G indicator toy Einstein.

Dragon C210.2 "Endurance" deployed into 197.8/216.8km/51.65° initial orbit.
Stage2 Debris Reentry in Indian Ocean on the first orbit.

Trunk reentry at 26 Apr 08:52 UTC on a track from Phoenix to Colorado Springs.
</div>]]></description>
