		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_41F039E362802106">
			<name>M1498 Eutelsat HB13F fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1498 Eutelsat HB13F fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 788km downrange

Fairing 2.3.

Fourth flight for active fairing half (after Starlink_G4-10, Transporter-5 and Starlink_G4-23).
Fourth flight for passive fairing half (after Starlink_G4-10, Transporter-5 and Starlink_G4-23).

SpX webcast: "The fairing halves that make up the fairing that we are using today are both flying for the fourth time on this mission."

Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
