			<name>M1831 Starlink_G4-36 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1831 Starlink_G4-36 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA20

Launch - 20-Oct-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 182 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1062.10, Fairing 2.2-se.

Totally 16686kg payload. 54pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (309 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 239.2/343.6km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in eastern Pacific on the first orbit..
</div>]]></description>
