			<name>M1831 Starlink_G4-36 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1831 Starlink_G4-36 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 20-Oct-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 182 B1062.10 - Marmac302 ASoG, Bob tug/support
MarineTraffic recovery position 661km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/117883 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2236m/s, apogee 136km, 1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn at alt 57-37km, reentry at 1643m/s, single engine 23s successful landing burn from 1.9km alt.
3m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
