		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_424F360B06C03FC0">
			<name>M1493 USSF-44 (FH-04) LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1493 USSF-44 (FH-04) LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 01-Nov-22 - FH v1.2.b5 Flight 4 NY-B1064 - CCAFS LZ-1

BECO at 1592m/s, apogee 111km, 1-3-1 engines 68s boostback burn, 1-3-1 engines 13s entry burn at alt 46-34km, reentry at 962m/s, single engine 22s successful landing burn from 1.8km alt.
~11m from bullseye landing.
FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/118501
</div>]]></description>
