			<name>M1631 Eutelsat HB13G ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1631 Eutelsat HB13G ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 03-Oct-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 181 B1067.7 - Marmac303 JRtI, Crosby Skipper tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 663km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/118867 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2298m/s, apogee 123km, 1-3-1 engines 25s entry burn at alt 61-39km, reentry at 1465m/s, single engine 26s successful landing burn from 2km alt..
3m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
