		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_424FC8089CF151F8">
			<name>M1631 Eutelsat HB13G fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1631 Eutelsat HB13G fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 797km downrange

Fairing 2.2-e/2.3 (vent holes at halves edges).

Sixth flight for active fairing half (after Sentinel-6 MF, Starlink_v1-L20, Starlink_G4-4, Starlink_G4-13 and Starlink_G4-27).
Fourth flight for passive fairing half (after GPS III SV05, Turksat-5B and Starlink_G4-34).

SpX webcast: "One half is flying for the 4th time and the other is flying for a 6th time."

Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by Bob.
</div>]]></description>
