			<name>M1415 CRS-26 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1415 CRS-26 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 26-Jul-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 187 B1076.1 - Marmac303 JRtI, Crosby Skipper tug

Planned recovery position 300km downrange (Radius of operation within 75km)

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/118611

MECO at 2033m/s, 1-3-1 engines 32s boostback burn, apogee 109km, 1-3-1 engines 14s entry burn at alt 49-36km, reentry at 1030m/s, single engine 34s successful landing burn.
11m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
