		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_4318DD450AD414CB">
			<name>M1809 OneWeb-L15 LZ-1 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1809 OneWeb-L15 LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 07-Dec-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1069.4 Flight 188 - CCAFS LZ-1

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/118759

MECO at 1725m/s, 1-3-1 engines 49s boostback burn, apogee 172km, 1-3-1 engines 16s entry burn at alt 51-35km, reentry at 884m/s, single engine 29s successful landing burn from 3km alt.
Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
