		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_4318DFCE20EF003F">
			<name>M1809 OneWeb-L15 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1809 OneWeb-L15 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 610km downrange

Fairing 2.3-s/2.2-se (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

SpX webcast: "this is the fifth and sixth flights of those fairing halves".

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
