			<name>M1421 SWOT launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1421 SWOT launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA21

Launch - 15-Dec-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 190 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1071.6, new fairing 2.3-s

2000kg Surface Water Ocean Topography (SWOT) polar satellite.

Deployment to 855.6/861.5km/77.6° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Pacific Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
