			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1824 MPOWER-A ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 16-Dec-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 191 B1067.8 - Marmac302 ASoG, Crosby Skipper tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 683km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/119277 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2329m/s, apogee 126km, 1-3-1 engines 21s entry burn at alt 64-44km, reentry at 1650m/s, single engine successful landing burn.
Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
