		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_4342D6B1BA2F05CB">
			<name>M1824 MPOWER-A fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1824 MPOWER-A fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 812km downrange

Fairing 2.3.

Fifth flight for active fairing half (after Starlink_v1-L24, Starlink_G4-6, Starlink_G4-18 and Starlink_G4-2).
Fourth flight for passive fairing half (after NROL-87, Starlink_G4-15 and Starlink_G4-22).

SpX webcast: "Fairing halves supporting today's mission are flight proven. One half having flown for the fourth time and the other having ... flying (excuse me) for its fifth time today."

Intact active fairing half scooped out from the water by Bob.
</div>]]></description>
