		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_4342D91E1561EFF4">
			<name>M1832 Starlink_G4-37 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1832 Starlink_G4-37 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA21

Launch - 07-Dec-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 192 - KSC LC-39A

Booster B1058.15, Fairing 2.2-se/2.3-s

Totally 16686kg payload. 54pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (309 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 239.1/342.2km/53.22° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in eastern Pacific on the first orbit..
</div>]]></description>
