</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1832 Starlink_G4-37 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 07-Dec-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 192 B1058.15 - Marmac303 JRtI, Doug tug/support
MarineTraffic recovery position 660km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/118284 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2243m/s, apogee 13`5km, 1-3-1 engines 18s entry burn at alt 58-39km, reentry at 1691m/s, single engine 23s successful landing burn from 1.9km alt.
4m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
