Launch - 28-Dec-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 193 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1062.11, fairing 2.3-s

Totally 16686kg payload. 54pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (309 kg each)

Planned nominal deployment to 219.6/344.8km/43° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit south of Cape Town.
</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
