			<name>M1923 Starlink_G5-1 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1923 Starlink_G5-1 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 28-Dec-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 193 B1062.11 - Marmac302 ASoG, Crosby Skipper tug, Doug support

MarineTraffic recovery position 644km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/119435 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2225m/s, apogee 130km, 1-3-1 engines 20s entry burn at alt 62-43km, reentry at 1579m/s, single engine 25s successful landing burn from 1.8km alt.
~7m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
