			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1923 Starlink_G5-1 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 638km downrange

fairing 2.3-s (without acoustic tiles).

SpX webcast: "fairing halves are flight proven"

Second flight for active fairing half (after Nilesat-301).
Second flight for passive fairing half (after Nilesat-301).

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
