		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_43AE03A40F823FD4">
			<name>M1822 OneWeb-L16 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1822 OneWeb-L16 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA22

Launch - 10-Jan-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 196 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster 1076.2, Fairing 2.2-se/2.3-s.

Totally 5908kg payload. 40pcs OneWeb Internet constellation satellites (147.7 kg each), on target orbit approx. 1200/1200km/86.4°.

Deployment into 609.9/613.2km/86.5° polar orbit
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Indian Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
