		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_43AE04AA78DEA381">
			<name>M1822 OneWeb-L16 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1822 OneWeb-L16 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 608km downrange

Fairing 2.2-se/2.3-s (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

SpX webcast: "those fairing half, one flew for a sixth time a the other flew for a seventh time".

Seventh flight for active fairing half.
Sixth flight for passive fairing half.

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
