			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1586 USSF-67 (FH-05) launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA22

Launch - 15-Jan-23 - Falcon Heavy b5 Flight 5 - KSC LC-39A

Expendable CC-B1070, NY-B1064.2, PY-B1065.2, Fairing 2.3.

First SpaceX mission direct to GEO.

~4000kg United States Space Force classified GEO satellite, with CBAS 2 (USA 342) and LDPE 3A satellites.

Deployment to 35199/35251km/0.06°GTO
</div>]]></description>
