			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1459 GPS III SV06 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA22

Launch - 18-Jan-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 197 - CCAFS SLC-40

Booster 1077.2, new fairing 2.3.

4352kg MEO satellite GPS III-SV06 (Amelia Earhart, NAVSTAR 82, USA 343)
Deployment into 399/20169.9km/55° orbit

Stage2 debris reentry south of South Africa at approx. 7hrs after launch.
</div>]]></description>
