			<name>M1459 GPS III SV06 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1459 GPS III SV06 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 18-Jun-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 197 B1077.2 - Marmac302 ASoG, Crosby Skipper tug, Doug support

MarineTraffic recovery position 644km downrange.

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/120134 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2290m/s, apogee 117km, 1-3-1 engines 24s entry burn at alt 61-39km, reentry at 1494m/s, single engine 27s successful landing burn from 2.2km alt.
6m from bullseye landing, secured by all arms of Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
