			<name>M1599 Starlink_G2-4 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1599 Starlink_G2-4 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.do/LHA21

Launch - 19-Jan-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 197 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1075.1, Fairing 2.3-s

Totally 15759kg payload. 51pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (309 kg each), on target orbit approx. 570/570km/70°

Planned nominal deployment to 219.7/342.2km/70° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in South Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
