			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1500 Amazonas Nexus ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 05-Feb-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 202 B1073.6 - Marmac303 JRtI, Crosby Skipper tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 627km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/120470 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2214m/s, apogee 114km, 1-3-1 engines 30s entry burn at alt 67-43km, reentry at 1288m/s, single engine 30s successful landing burn from 2.8km alt..
