		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_446D801D712AB2C0">
			<name>M1926 Starlink_G5-4 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1926 Starlink_G5-4 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-23

Launch - 12-Feb-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 203 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1062.12, Fairing 2.2-se.

Totally 17050kg payload. 55pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (310 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 305.2/346.1km/43° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit south of Cape Town.
</div>]]></description>
