</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 18-Feb-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 205 B1077.3 - Marmac303 JRtI, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 648km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x120622 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2270m/s, apogee 122km, 1-3-1 engines 25s entry burn at alt 65-42km, reentry at 1452m/s, single engine 26s successful landing burn from 2.2km alt..
