			<name>M1464 CCP-06 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1464 CCP-06 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-23

Launch - 02-Mar-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 207 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1078.1

Crew: CDR - Stephen Bowen (NASA) / PLT - Woody Hoburg (NASA) / MS1 - Andrei Fedyaev (Roscosmos) / MS2 - Emerati Sultan Alneyadi (MBRSC)

Zero-G indicator toy Suhail (Canopus) in space suit.

Dragon C206.4 "Endeavour" deployed into 198.9/216.7km/51.65° initial orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry south of Australia on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
