			<name>M1602 Starlink_G2-7 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1602 Starlink_G2-7 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-23

Launch - 03-Mar-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 208 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1061.12, Fairing 2.3-s

Totally 15759kg payload. 51pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (309 kg each), on target orbit approx. 570/570km/70°

Planned nominal deployment to 229.6/340.5km/70° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in South Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
