		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_44DE0DA6D6DEB394">
			<name>M1602 Starlink_G2-7 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1602 Starlink_G2-7 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 03-Mar-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 208 B1061.12 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Scorpius tug, Go Quest support

MarineTraffic recovery position 663km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: bit.ly/x120891 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2253m/s, apogee 134km, 1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn at alt 57-37km, reentry at 1654m/s, single engine 23s successful landing burn from 1.9km alt.
1m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
