</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1860 OneWeb-L17 LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 09-Mar-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1062.13 Flight 209 - CCAFS LZ-1

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x121097

MECO at 1708m/s, 1-3-1 engines 47s boostback burn, apogee 129km, 1-3-1 engines 17s entry burn at alt 51-33km, reentry at 849m/s, single engine 30s successful landing burn from 3.1km alt.
Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
