			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1628 CRS-27 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 15-Mar-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 210 B1073.7 - Marmac302 ASoG, Doug tug/support

MarineTraffic recovery position 300km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x120906 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2010m/s, 1-3-1 engines 32s boostback burn, apogee 111km, 1-3-1 engines 16s entry burn at alt 50-35km, reentry at 943m/s, single engine 31s successful landing burn from ~3km alt.
2m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
