</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1800 Starlink_G2-8 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-23

Launch - 17-Mar-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 211 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1071.8, Fairing 2.3-s

Totally 16120kg payload. 52pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (310 kg each), on target orbit approx. 570/570km/70°

Planned nominal deployment to 229.5/342.0km/70° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in South Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
