</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1927 Starlink_G5-5 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-24

Launch - 24-Mar-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 213 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1067.10, Fairing 2.3-s/2.2-se

Totally 17360kg payload. 56pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (310 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 306.5/345.0km/43° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit south of Cape Town.
</div>]]></description>
