		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_455FA1229BB0983C">
			<name>M1641 SDA-0A LZ-4 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1641 SDA-0A LZ-4 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 02-Apr-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 215 B1075.2 - VAFB LZ-4

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x121598 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 1673m/s, 1-3-1 engines 53s boostback burn, apogee 122km, 1-3-1 engines 16s entry burn at alt 50-34km, reentry at 886m/s, single engine 36s successful landing burn from 4.8km alt.
~5m from bullseye landing.
</div>]]></description>
