		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_459D02F14C6A923E">
			<name>M1770 Transporter-7 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1770 Transporter-7 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-24

Launch - 14-Apr-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 217 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1063.10, Fairing 2.3-s
First flight with modified MVac nozzle extension for increasing cadence and reducing costs
Transporter-7 SmallSat Rideshare payload with 51 payloads (including CubeSats, MicroSats, hosted payloads, and orbital transfer vehicles).

Planned nominal deployment into 502/519km/97.4° SSO orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in South Pacific.
</div>]]></description>
