			<name>M1770 Transporter-7 LZ-4 landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1770 Transporter-7 LZ-4 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 14-Apr-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 B1063.10 Flight 217 - VSFB LZ-4

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x122200

MECO at 1840m/s, 1-3-1 engines 62s boostback burn, apogee 126km, single engine 12s entry burn at alt 51-37km, reentry at 1244m/s, 1-3-1 engines 19s successful landing burn from 1km alt.
</div>]]></description>
