		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_45B0C19D737CC0F3">
			<name>M1888 Starlink_G6-2 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1888 Starlink_G6-2 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-24

Launch - 19-Apr-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 218 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1067.11, Fairing 2.3-s.

Totally 17050kg payload. 21pcs SpaceX Starlink v2 Mini satellites (810 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 351.5/360.5km/43° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit south of Cape Town.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
