		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_45B0C2B96700C98F">
			<name>M1888 Starlink_G6-2 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1888 Starlink_G6-2 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 19-Apr-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 218 B106t7.11 - Marmac302 ASoG, Crosby Skipper tug, Doug support

MarineTraffic recovery position 608km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x121332 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2197m/s, apogee 117km, 1-3-1 engines 23s entry burn at alt 64-44km, reentry at 1443m/s, single engine 27s successful landing burn.

7m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
