			<name>M2031 Starlink_G3-5 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M2031 Starlink_G3-5 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-24

Launch - 27-Apr-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 219 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1061.13, Fairing 2.3-s/2.2-se

Totally 16250kg payload. 46pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (306.6 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/97.6°.

Planned nominal deployment to 304.5/357.0km/97.66° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in southern Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
