			<name>M1451 ViaSat-3.1 (FH-06) fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1451 ViaSat-3.1 (FH-06) fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 1954km downrange

Fairing 2.2-e/2.3 (vent holes at halves edges).

100-th flight of re-flown payload fairing. First FH to launch with fight proven fairing halves.

Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
