		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_45FA2179E0877CBA">
			<name>M1928 Starlink_G5-6 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1928 Starlink_G5-6 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 04-May-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 221 B1069.7 - Marmac302 ASoG, Crosby Skipper tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 639km downrange.

MECO at 2276m/s, apogee 117km, 1-3-1 engines 18s entry burn at alt 64-48km, reentry at 1705m/s, single engine 22s successful landing burn from 1.9km alt.
2m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
