Booster 1075.3, Fairing 2.2-se

Totally 15810kg payload. 51pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (310 kg each), on target orbit approx. 570/570km/70°

Planned nominal deployment to 229.5/341.1km/70° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in South Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
