		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_462D1C310F5331FB">
			<name>Starlink_G5-9 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Starlink_G5-9 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 14-May-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 223 B1067.11 - Marmac303 JRtI, Crosby Skipper tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 653km downrange.

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x123086 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2273m/s, apogee 118km, 1-3-1 engines 16s entry burn at alt 62-47km, reentry at 1766m/s, single engine 24s successful landing burn from 1.9km alt.
4m from bullseye landing. Secured by two arms of Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
