			<name>M1795 Iridium-9/OneWeb-L19 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1795 Iridium-9/OneWeb-L19 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-25

Launch - 20-May-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 225 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1063.11.
Modified MVac nozzle extension for increasing cadence and reducing costs
Totally 6663kg payload - Iridium NEXT Satellites 174, 177, 178, 179, 181 (860 kg each) with dispenser and 16pcs OneWeb Internet constellation satellites (147.7 kg each), on target orbit approx. 1200/1200km/86.4°.

Deployment into 620.1/634.8km/86.68° polar orbit.
S2 reentry area south of Cape Town during second orbit.
</div>]]></description>
