			<name>M1634 AX-2 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1634 AX-2 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-25

Launch - 21-May-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 226 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1080.1

Axiom Space contracted spaceflight crew mission to ISS.
Crew: CDR - Peggy Whitson / PLT - John Shoffner / MS1 - Ali AlQarni / MS2 - Rayyanah Barnawi
Zero-G indicator Gigi.

Dragon C212.2 ''Freedom'' deployed into 217.9/310.1km/51.65° initial orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in South Pacific on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
