</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1841 Starlink_G2-10 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-25

Launch - 31-May-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 228 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1061.14, Fairing 2.3-s/2.2-se

Totally 16120kg payload. 52pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (310 kg each), on target orbit approx. 570/570km/70°

Planned nominal deployment to 222.3/333.5km/70° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in South Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
