			<name>M1841 Starlink_G2-10 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1841 Starlink_G2-10 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 31-May-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 228 B1061.14 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Scorpius tug
Planned recovery position 660km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: bit.ly/x123606 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2262m/s, apogee 134km, 1-3-1 engines 15s entry burn at alt 58-40km, reentry at 1809m/s, single engine 22s successful landing burn from 1.8km alt.
~1m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
