			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1891 Starlink_G6-4 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-25

Launch - 04-Jun-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 229 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1078.3, Fairing 2.2-se/2.3-s

Totally 17860kg payload. 22pcs SpaceX Starlink v2 Mini satellites (810 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 314.2/322.8km/43° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit south of Cape Town.
</div>]]></description>
