			<name>M1891 Starlink_G6-4 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1891 Starlink_G6-4 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 04-Jun-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 229 B1078.3 - Marmac303 JRtI, Crosby Skipper tug, Bob support

MarineTraffic recovery position 623km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x122874 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2249m/s, apogee 117km, 1-3-1 engines 16s entry burn at alt 62-48km, reentry at 1756m/s, single engine 16s successful landing burn from 1.9km alt.
4m from bullseye landing. Secured by three arms of Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
