		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_46A2A7722C806093">
			<name>M1629 CRS-28 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1629 CRS-28 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-26

Launch - 05-Jun-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 230 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1077.5
Modified MVac nozzle extension for increasing cadence and reducing costs.
Total Pressurized Cargo Upmass with packaging 1964 kg
Unpressurized Trunk payload 1340 kg - 2x iROSA (ISS Roll-Out Solar Arrays)

Dragon C208.4 deployed into 226.05/398.05km/51.57° initial orbit.

Stage2 debris reentry in South Pacific on the first orbit.

The trunk reentered over the South Atlantic east of Argentina at 04 Aug 03:56 UTC.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B154E8C3F2C6E06345F</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
