			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1941 Starlink_G5-11 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-26

Launch - 10-Jun-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 231 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1073.9, Fairing 2.3-s

Totally 16120kg payload. 52pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (310 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 299.2/339.5km/43° orbit.

Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Indian Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
