			<name>M1929 Starlink_G5-7 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1929 Starlink_G5-7 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-26

Launch - 22-Jun-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 234 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1075.4, Fairing 2.3-s

Totally 14570kg payload 47pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (310 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/43°

Planned nominal deployment to 229.1/335.7km/43° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in North Pacific during first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
