		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_46FB04ABB49C6364">
			<name>M1942 Starlink_G5-12 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1942 Starlink_G5-12 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-26

Launch - 23-Jun-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 235 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1069.8, Fairing 2.2-se/2.3-s.

Totally 17360kg payload. 56pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (310 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 297.9/339.7km/43° orbit.

Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Indian Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
