		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_4709A5B999B0F3DB">
			<name>M1942 Starlink_G5-12 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1942 Starlink_G5-12 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 24-Jun-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 235 B1069.8 - Marmac303 JRtI, Bob support
Planned recovery position 640km downrange.

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x124157 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2273m/s, apogee 118km, 1-3-1 engines 17s entry burn at alt 63-48km, reentry at 1716m/s, single engine 22s successful landing burn from 1.9km alt.
4m from bullseye landing. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
