		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_4709A709387D10C4">
			<name>M1942 Starlink_G5-12 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1942 Starlink_G5-12 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 631km downrange

Fairing 2.2-se/2.3-s (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

SpX webcast: "one half is flying for the seventh time today and the other is flying for the tenth time".
First tenth flight of the fairing half.

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Bob.
</div>]]></description>
