			<name>M2178 Starlink_G5-15 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M2178 Starlink_G5-15 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-26

Launch - 15-Jul-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 239 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1060.16, Fairing 2.3-s/2.2-se

Totally 16740kg payload. 54pcs SpaceX Starlink v1.5 satellites with laser intersatellite links (310 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.
Final launch of the Starlink v1.5 satellites.
Planned nominal deployment to 298.8/338.9km/43° orbit.

Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Indian Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
