			<name>M2178 Starlink_G5-15 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M2178 Starlink_G5-15 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 614km downrange

Fairing 2.3-s/2.2-se (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

SpX webcast: "Both of the fairing halves that flew on tonight mission are proven with one half flying for the ninth time and the other flying for its tenth.".

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
