</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1874 Starlink_G6-15 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-27

Launch - 19-Jul-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 240 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1071.10

Totally 12150kg payload. 15pcs SpaceX Starlink v2 Mini satellites (810 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 284.5/314.8km/43° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in East Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
