			<name>M1874 Starlink_G6-15 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1874 Starlink_G6-15 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 19-Jul-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 240 B1071.10 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Scorpius tug.
Planned recovery position 660km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: bit.ly/x124763 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2156m/s, apogee 180km, 1-3-1 engines 21s entry burn at alt 69-43km, reentry at 1536m/s, single engine 22s successful landing burn from 1.9km alt.
~0m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
