			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1892 Starlink_G6-6 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Bob MarineTraffic recovery position 677km downrange.

Fairing 2.2-se (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

SpX webcast: "Both of the fairing halves that are supporting today's mission are flight proven. One half is flying for its seventh time today and the other is flying for its eight time.".

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Bob.
</div>]]></description>
