		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_47AEAF41724B46EE">
			<name>M1893 Starlink_G6-7 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1893 Starlink_G6-7 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 28-Jul-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 242 B1062.15 - Marmac302 ASoG, Signet Titan tug

MarineTraffic recovery position 619km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x124200 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2232m/s, apogee 117km, 1-3-1 engines 19s entry burn at alt 64-47km, reentry at 1617m/s, single engine 24s successful landing burn from 2.0km alt.
5m from bullseye landing. Secured by three arms of Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
