			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1468 EchoStar-24 (FH-07) launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-27

Launch - 29-Jul-23 - Falcon Heavy b5 Flight 7 - KSC LC-39A

Expendable CC-B1074.1, NY-B1064.3, PY-B1065.3, Fairing 2.3.

Approx. 9200kg GEO sattelite Hughes Jupiter 3 (EchoStar-24)
Heaviest comercial communication satellite ever to launched into geostationary orbit.
Deployment to 8001.2/35504.5km/10.39° GTO.

BECO at 1638m/s, MECO at 3991m/s
</div>]]></description>
