</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1468 EchoStar-24 (FH-07) LZ-1 landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 29-Jul-23 - FH v1.2.b5 Flight 7 NY-B1064.3 - CCAFS LZ-1

BECO at 1638m/s, apogee 100km, 1-3-1 engines 73s boostback burn, single engine 11s entry burn at alt 51-40km, reentry at 1149m/s, 1-3-1 engines 21s successful landing burn from 1.4km alt.
</div>]]></description>
