SpX webcast: &quot;Both fairings supporting today&apos;s mission are flight proven, with one half flying for its fifth time and the other for its sixth.&quot;.

Both intact fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
