			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1626 Intelsat G-37 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 03-Aug-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 243 B1077.6 - Marmac303 JRtI, Crosby Skipper tug

MarineTraffic recovery position 661km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: bit.ly/x124120 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2310m/s, apogee 122km, 1-3-1 engines 20s entry burn at alt 66-48km, reentry at 1676m/s, single engine 25s successful landing burn from 2.1km alt.
~4m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
