			<name>M1895 Starlink_G6-8 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1895 Starlink_G6-8 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-27

Launch - 07-Aug-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 243 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1078.4, Fairing 2.3-s

Totally 17820kg payload. 22pcs SpaceX Starlink v2 Mini satellites (810 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 291.5/300.4km/43° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Indian Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
