		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_47F7939DB22F0DC7">
			<name>M1876 Starlink_G6-20 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1876 Starlink_G6-20 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing - 08-Aug-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 245 B1075.5 - Marmac304 OCISLY, Scorpius tug.
Planned recovery position 660km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: bit.ly/x124766 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2128m/s, apogee 179km, 1-3-1 engines 22s entry burn at alt 69-42km, reentry at 1503m/s, single engine 25s successful landing burn from 2.2km alt.
~8m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber.
</div>]]></description>
