		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_47F7EE0CC16062D4">
			<name>M1894 Starlink_G6-9 launch groundtrack
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1894 Starlink_G6-9 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-27

Launch - 11-Aug-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 246 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1069.9, Fairing 2.2-se/2.3-s.

Totally 17820kg payload. 22pcs SpaceX Starlink v2 Mini satellites (810 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 291.3/301.1km/43° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Indian Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
