			<name>M1894 Starlink_G6-9 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1894 Starlink_G6-9 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 642km downrange.

Fairing 2.2-se/2.3-s (without acoustic tiles, vent holes at halves edges).

SpX webcast: "Fairing halves supporting today's mission have flown on previous missions with one flying for a tenth time and the other for its eleventh flight.".

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
