			<name>M1872 Starlink_G6-10 fairing recovery position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1872 Starlink_G6-10 fairing recovery position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Doug MarineTraffic recovery position 672km downrange.

Fairing 2.3-s (without acoustic tiles).

SpX webcast: "Both of the fairing halves that supported today's mission are flight proven, with one half flying for its 10th time and the other its 11th.".

Intact active and passive fairing halves scooped out from the water by Doug.
</div>]]></description>
