			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M2183 Starlink_G7-1 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Middle track inside hazard areas http://bit.ly/LHA-27

Launch - 22-Aug-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 248 - VSFB SLC-4E

Booster 1061.15, Fairing 2.3-s

Totally 17010kg payload.21pcs SpaceX Starlink v2 Mini satellites (810 kg each), on target orbit approx. 540/540km/53.2°

Planned nominal deployment to 292.9/302.7km/53.05° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in East Pacific after first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
