</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1747 CCP-07 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-28

Launch - 26-Aug-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 249 - KSC LC-39A

Booster 1081.1

Crew: CDR - Jasmin Moghbeli (NASA) / PLT - Andreas Mogensen (ESA) / MS1 - Satoshi Furukawa (JAXA) / MS2 - Konstantin Borisov (Roscosmos)

Zero-G indicator toy 'Sasha the three-toed Sloth'.

Dragon C210.3 "Endurance" deployed into 195.08/214.22km/51.64° initial orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry in South Pacific on the first orbit.
</div>]]></description>
