</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1896 Starlink_G6-11 launch groundtrack
</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-28

Launch - 27-Aug-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 250 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1080.3, Fairing 2.3-s.

