			<name>M1897 Starlink_G6-12 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1897 Starlink_G6-12 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing -04-Sep-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 253 B1073.10 - Marmac303 JRtI, Signet Titan tug.

MarineTraffic recovery position 592km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x124204 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2169m/s, apogee 115km, 1-3-1 engines 25s entry burn at alt 64-43km, reentry at 1349m/s, single engine 24s successful landing burn from 2.2km alt.
4m from bullseye landing. Fully secured by Octograbber. Landing legs stowed.
</div>]]></description>
