			<name>M1875 Starlink_G6-18 ASDS position
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: M1875 Starlink_G6-18 ASDS position
</div><div><b>description</b>: Landing -24-Sep-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5- Flight 258 B1060.17 - Marmac303 JRtI, Bob tug/support.

MarineTraffic recovery position 614km downrange

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x124214 (with radius of operation within 75km)

MECO at 2219m/s, apogee 116km, 1-3-1 engines 21s entry burn at alt 64-46km, reentry at 1512m/s, single engine 25s successful landing burn from 2.0km alt.
6m from bullseye landing. Secured by three arms of Octograbber. 
</div>]]></description>
