</div><div><b>description</b>: Ground track based on hazard areas and SpX webcast http://bit.ly/LHA-29

Launch - 05-Oct-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 - Flight 261 - CCSFS SLC-40

Booster B1076.8, Fairing 2.3-s

Totally 17820kg payload. 22pcs SpaceX Starlink v2 Mini satellites (810 kg each), on target orbit approx. 560/560km/43°.

Planned nominal deployment to 291.3/300.2km/42.99° orbit.
Stage2 debris reentry during second orbit in Indian Ocean.
</div>]]></description>
