		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2775FA652257CA54">
			<name>CCP-DM1 CrewDragon landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CCP-DM1 CrewDragon landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C204 landing - 08-Mar-19 - Go Searcher & GO Navigator MarineTrafic exact recovery position
FCC APPLICATION: https://goo.gl/HUCJdh (10km northward)
NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
Dragon landing hazard area https://goo.gl/HXcS8Q

Total Pressurized Cargo Downmass - 149kg
Trunk decayed 20 Jul 2021.
Launched - 02-Mar-19 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 69 - KSC LC-39A

@elonmusk 8 Mar 2019:
Atmospheric entry at 17,000 mph is like a meteor & will vaporize steel. Burn marks below are on cold side. Main heatshield on bottom.
All good, system maintained room temperature within spacecraft
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0FA8883B1D2C6E06349B</styleUrl>
