		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2D18832FA8FF8468">
			<name>CCP-IFAT CrewDragon landing
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CCP-IFAT CrewDragon landing
</div><div><b>description</b>: Go Searcher and Go Navigator recovery boats location 42km downrange
Planned landing 31km downrange http://bit.do/97074

Crew Dragon C205 SuperDraco LAS High Altitude In-Flight Abort Test - 19-Jan-20
Drogue deployment at 5.8 km, mains deployment at 2 km.

New four main Mk.3 parachutes in use (Zylon lines, optimized stitching pattern,..)
NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
CrewDragon recovered by GO Searcher. Trunk recovered by GO Navigator.

@elonmusk 20 Jan 2020:
Dragon trunk from in-flight abort test is in surprisingly good shape!

Launched - M1357 Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 79 - KSC LC-39A
</div>]]></description>
