Drogue deployment at 5.8 km, mains deployment at 2 km.

New four main Mk.3 parachutes in use (Zylon lines, optimized stitching pattern,..)
NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
CrewDragon recovered by GO Searcher. Trunk recovered by GO Navigator.

