		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2D8026576DEAD66A">
			<name>CCP-DM2 CrewDragon Pensacola Recovery Location
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CCP-DM2 CrewDragon Pensacola Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C206 landing - 02-Aug-20
Go Navigator recovery vessel on the position.
NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/99461
65km southwest of the Pensacola Naval Air Station Dock (Radius of operation within 75km).
Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA11

Dragon Trunk decayed 11-Dec-20 13:59 UTC to South Pacific
Launched - 30-May-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 85 - KSC LC-39A

@elonmusk 02 Aug 2020:
Dragon is stable in the water
</div>]]></description>
