		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_31923D404285DC69">
			<name>CRS-21 Dragon2 Tampa Recovery Location
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CRS-21 Dragon2 Tampa Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C208 landing - 14-Jan-21
GO Navigator recovery vessel on the position.
Coastguard ship 'Shrike' in the area.
NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
Helicopter N554AC carryied the priority cargo from from GO Navigator to KSC.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA12

Total Pressurized Cargo Downmass with packaging approx. 2000kg

Launched - 06-Dec-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 101 - KSC LC-39A

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/102959
144km northwest of the Tampa (Radius of operation within 75km).
</div>]]></description>
