			<name>CCP-01 CrewDragon Panama City Recovery Location
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CCP-01 CrewDragon Panama City Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C207 ''Resilience'' landing - 02-May-21

GO Navigator MarineTrafic exact recovery position.
Coastguard Coastguard cutter "Benjamin Dailey' in the area.
NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
US Air Force plane in the area.
Helicopters N591AC and N554AC pick up the four astronauts.carryied the priority cargo from from GO Navigator to Pensacola.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA12

Launched - 16-Nov-20 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 98 - KSC LC-39A

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/103704
137km southeast of the Pensacola Naval Air Station Dock (Radius of operation within 75km).
</div>]]></description>
