Go Searcher MarineTraffic recovery position
133km northeast of Cape Canaveral.

Coastguard ship in the area.
NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
Helicopter Airbus EC225-LP carryied the priority cargo from from Go Searcher to KSC.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA15

Launched - 29-Aug-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 124 - KSC LC-39A

