			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CCP-02 CrewDragon Pensacola Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C206.2 landing - 09-Nov-21
GO Navigator recovery vessel on the position.
77km southeast of Pensacola.
Visible lagging of one parachute.
NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
Two helicopters Airbus H225 carryied the crew from Go Navigator to Pensacola.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA15

Launched - 23-Apr-21 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 114 - KSC LC-39A

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/105529 (Radius of operation within 75km).
