			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: AX-1 CrewDragon Jacksonville Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C206.3 landing - 25-Apr-22
Megan recovery vessel on the position.
145km east of Jacksonville.

Cessna 560 Citation V plane in the area.
Helicopter Airbus H225 carryied the crew from Megan to Jacksonville.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA17

More than 90kf of science and supplies cargo downmass.
Launched - 08-Apr-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 147 - KSC LC-39A

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/112425 (Radius of operation within 75km).
</div>]]></description>
