			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CCP-03 CrewDragon Tampa Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C210.1 landing - 06-May-22
Shannon recovery vessel on the position.
143km west of Tampa

NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
Helicopter Airbus H225 carryied the crew from Megan to Jacksonville.
Cessna 560 Citation V plane in the area.
Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA15

