		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_41EDFD966FE56C86">
			<name>CCP-04 CrewDragon Jacksonville Recovery Location
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CCP-04 CrewDragon Jacksonville Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C212.1 landing - 14-Oct-22
Megan recovery vessel on the position.
281km north of Port Canveral

NASA research chase plane Martin WB-57 Canberra (N927NA) in the area.
Boeing P-8A Poseidon in the area
Helicopter Airbus H225 (RAP761) carryied the crew from Megan to Jacksonville.
Cessna 560 Citation V (RAP701) take cargo form Megan to Jacksonville.
Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA17

Launched - 27-Apr-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 150 - KSC LC-39A

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/113481 (Radius of operation within 75km).
</div>]]></description>
