			<name>CRS-26 Dragon2 Tampa Recovery Location
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CRS-26 Dragon2 Tampa Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C211.1 landing - 11-Jan-23
Megan recovery position
NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
Helicopter Eurocopter Super Puma EC-225 LP (N561AC) carryied the priority cargo from from Megan to KSC.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA21

Total Pressurized Cargo Downmass with packaging about 1990kg.
Launched - 26-Nov-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 187 - KSC LC-39A

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/118621 (Radius of operation within 75km).

Trunk re-entered 18:28 UTC 21 Jan 2023 over northern Peru.
</div>]]></description>
