		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_44ED8F112662B130">
			<name>CCP-05 CrewDragon Tampa Recovery Location
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CCP-05 CrewDragon Tampa Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C210.2 landing - 12-Mar-23
Shannon recovery vessel on the position.
142km west of Tampa Bay Dock

Helicopters Airbus H225 (RAP761 and RAP701) carryied the crew from Shannon to KSC.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.do/LHA20

Launched - 05-Oct-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 178 - KSC LC-39A

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.do/120529 (Radius of operation within 75km).
</div>]]></description>
