		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_459D0B974DE55827">
			<name>CRS-27 Dragon2 Tampa Recovery Location
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CRS-27 Dragon2 Tampa Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C209.3 landing - 15-Apr-23
Shannon recovery vessel on the position.
Two NASAs research chase planes WB-57 in the area.
Airbus Helicopter H135 (N561AC) carryied the priority cargo from from Shannon to St. Petersburg.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.ly/LHA-23

Total Pressurized Cargo Downmass about 1950kg.
Launched - 15-Mar-22 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 210 - KSC LC-39A

FCC APPLICATION: http://bit.ly/x120918 (Radius of operation within 75km).
</div>]]></description>
