			<name>AX-2 CrewDragon Panama City Recovery Location
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: AX-2 CrewDragon Panama City Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C212.2 ''Freedom'' landing - 31-May-23
Megan recovery vessel on the position.

NASA research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
Helicopter Airbus H135 in the area.
Two helicopters Airbus H225 carryied the crew from Megan to Pensacola.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.ly/LHA-25

Launched - 21-May-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 226 - KSC LC-39A

FCC APPLICATION: https://bit.ly/x123064 (Radius of operation within 15km).
</div>]]></description>
