			<name>CRS-28 Dragon2 Jacksonville Recovery Location
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CRS-28 Dragon2 Jacksonville Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C208.4 landing - 30-Jun-23
Shannon recovery vessel on the position.
NASAs research chase plane WB-57 in the area.
Airbus Helicopter H225 (N561AC) carryied the priority cargo from from Shannon to Cape Canaveral.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.ly/LHA-26

Total Pressurized Cargo Downmass about 1630kg.
Launched - 05-Jun-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 230 - KSC LC-39A

Area within 16km
NAVAREA IV 713/23(11)
NAVAREA IV 725/23(11)
NAVAREA IV 728/23(11)
</div>]]></description>
