			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: CCP-06 CrewDragon Jacksonville Recovery Location
</div><div><b>description</b>: Dragon C206.4 "Endeavour" landing - 04-Sep-23
Megan recovery vessel on the position.

NASA research chase plane WB-57 and Airbus Helicopters H135 in the area.
Helicopters Airbus H225 (RAP761 and RAP701) carryied the crew from Megan.

Dragon landing hazard area http://bit.ly/LHA-23

Launched - 02-Mar-23 - Falcon 9 v1.2.b5 Flight 207 - KSC LC-39A
</div>]]></description>
