			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: LC-39A Water Tower</div><div><b>description</b>: LC-39A Marine Radar type - Garmin 2526 xHD2

"This radar will be attached to a horizontal structural member on the pad 39A water tower and emission will be masked to radiate only between 328 to 135 degrees azimuth (over the Atlantic Ocean). Please note that this radar has an FCC equipment authorization:"
https://goo.gl/xxZ5FQ</div>]]></description>
