		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2620B51C0A73E5BD">
			<name>LC-39 Launch Control Center Firing Room 4</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: LC-39 Launch Control Center Firing Room 4</div><div><b>description</b>: Hans Koenigsmann, CRS-16 Pre-Launch Presser 2018-12-03: 
The Launch Control Formerly Known As Firing Room 4 has been used on I think our last mission here from the Cape. Going forward, we will use Launch Control Formerly Known As Firing Room 4 more and more.

DM-1 Pre-Launch Presser
2019-02-28:
We are actually in Firing Room 4 in, I guess it's called the Launch Control Center, too? We basically moved, our consoles are pretty much just monitors and software, so we moved them over there, and we're enjoying a great view to the pad. We integrated NASA operators within us. So it's, we had several missions where we trained that.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_03F3A8B2232C6E0634C5</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">LC-39 Launch Control Center Firing Room 4</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Hans Koenigsmann, CRS-16 Pre-Launch Presser 2018-12-03: 
The Launch Control Formerly Known As Firing Room 4 has been used on I think our last mission here from the Cape. Going forward, we will use Launch Control Formerly Known As Firing Room 4 more and more.

DM-1 Pre-Launch Presser
2019-02-28:
We are actually in Firing Room 4 in, I guess it&apos;s called the Launch Control Center, too? We basically moved, our consoles are pretty much just monitors and software, so we moved them over there, and we&apos;re enjoying a great view to the pad. We integrated NASA operators within us. So it&apos;s, we had several missions where we trained that.
</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
