					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">SpaceX has obtained permission to use a small plot of land on CCAFS to install an antenna.
The concrete pad for this antenna will be 20.72 x 20.72 = 429 sf. This location also has existing concrete from older structures.
Attached, please find, the design of the antenna pad, and the location on the Cape for LC-47 Antenna Site.

https://permitting.sjrwmd.com/apps/idcplg?IdcService=GET_FILE&amp;coreContentOnly=1&amp;RevisionSelectionMethod=Latest&amp;allowInterrupt=1&amp;dDocName=EREG_6698801</SimpleData>
