		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_29C45467B5D0CDC8">
			<name>Proposed Concrete Staging Pad
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Proposed Concrete Staging Pad
</div><div><b>description</b>: Roberts Rd. & Sr3 Merritt Island, FL 32953

This set of plans represents a design/construction package for a pre-engineered metal building, drainage, and flatwork of the space x site. The civil sitework construction components consist generally of surface work to support the proposed site construction.

Development to include mass grading in the northern portion of the site and the construction of a hangar facility with associated parking, vehicle use areas and infrastructure.

https://permitting.sjrwmd.com/apps/idcplg?IdcService=GET_FILE&coreContentOnly=1&RevisionSelectionMethod=Latest&allowInterrupt=1&dDocName=EREG_6893697</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02E5E1AA822C6E06349D</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">Proposed Concrete Staging Pad
</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Roberts Rd. &amp; Sr3 Merritt Island, FL 32953

This set of plans represents a design/construction package for a pre-engineered metal building, drainage, and flatwork of the space x site. The civil sitework construction components consist generally of surface work to support the proposed site construction.

Development to include mass grading in the northern portion of the site and the construction of a hangar facility with associated parking, vehicle use areas and infrastructure.

