</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Hangar X & Admin Building
</div><div><b>description</b>: Roberts Rd. & Sr3 Merritt Island, FL 32953

Hangar X - main booster processing facility at the Cape.
Since about 29 Jun 2021
4 processing lanes for booster refurbishment
5 "garage bays" for storage of boosters
Refurbishment time ~ 2-4 weeks


This set of plans represents a design/construction package for a pre-engineered metal building, drainage, and flatwork of the space x site. Development to include mass grading in the northern portion of the site and the construction of a hangar facility with associated parking, vehicle use areas and infrastructure.

