		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28BB9A1B2D320A56">
			<name>Dragon C102 - COTS Demo 2+ mission</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Dragon C102 - COTS Demo 2+ mission</div><div><b>description</b>: First commercial vehicle to dock with the ISS.

Launched by F9-003 - 22-May-12 - Falcon 9 v1.0 Flight 3 - CCAFS SLC-40

@ExploreSpaceKSC 14 Dec 2016
Don't feed the #Dragon: Space Flown #SpaceX Dragon capsule now on display at #KennedySpaceCenter in #NASA Now exhibit. #JoinTheJourney
Same Dragon as displayed here in Feb 2015 from the C2+ or COTS Demo Flight 2 mission.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_020D0E17362C6E0634CF</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">Dragon C102 - COTS Demo 2+ mission</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">First commercial vehicle to dock with the ISS.

Launched by F9-003 - 22-May-12 - Falcon 9 v1.0 Flight 3 - CCAFS SLC-40

@ExploreSpaceKSC 14 Dec 2016
Don&apos;t feed the #Dragon: Space Flown #SpaceX Dragon capsule now on display at #KennedySpaceCenter in #NASA Now exhibit. #JoinTheJourney
Same Dragon as displayed here in Feb 2015 from the C2+ or COTS Demo Flight 2 mission.
</SimpleData>
