		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_207E855520310C07">
			<name>Falcon fairing storage/refurbish facility</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Falcon fairing storage/refurbish facility</div><div><b>description</b>: Falcon fairing (PLF) processing storage/refurbish facility.

Planed Falcon booster storage/refurbish facility.
Former Spacehab Payload Processing Facility.

Signed a five-year lease the now-vacant facility, and plans to build an adjacent hangar on vacant land adjacent to that site.

620 Magellan Road, Port Canaveral, Florida 32920

http://www.floridatoday.com/story/tech/science/space/spacex/2017/03/20/spacex-signs-lease-port-canaveral-booster-refurbishing/99402414/
</div>]]></description>
