		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_21F8B1AD8FF8F354">
			<name>SpaceX Operation Area</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SpaceX Operation Area</div><div><b>description</b>: SpaceX proposes to develop a site for booster and fairing processing and storage, a new launch and landing control center and a rocket garden at KSC. 
This Roberts Road site would require approximately 27 hectares (ha) (67 acres [ac]) of land for proposed facility development. Roberts Road and A Avenue would be paved to provide access on the south and north sides. A conceptual site plan is provided in Section 2 (Figure 2-1). SpaceX requires the booster and fairing processing and storage facility immediately to support a growing launch manifest and enable reuse. In the future, additional facilities may be required for manifest support or new launch vehicle specifications. However, at this time, the scope of future needs has not been defined and these facilities are not in planned development. </div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_68907E8E662C6E0634C2</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">SpaceX Operation Area</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">SpaceX proposes to develop a site for booster and fairing processing and storage, a new launch and landing control center and a rocket garden at KSC. 
This Roberts Road site would require approximately 27 hectares (ha) (67 acres [ac]) of land for proposed facility development. Roberts Road and A Avenue would be paved to provide access on the south and north sides. A conceptual site plan is provided in Section 2 (Figure 2-1). SpaceX requires the booster and fairing processing and storage facility immediately to support a growing launch manifest and enable reuse. In the future, additional facilities may be required for manifest support or new launch vehicle specifications. However, at this time, the scope of future needs has not been defined and these facilities are not in planned development. </SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
			<gx:Carousel>
