		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_3108389709792648">
			<name>Test platform (SN7)</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Test platform (SN7)</div><div><b>description</b>: 15 Jun 2020 - Test Tank SN7 pressure test
@elonmusk 16 Jun 2020:
Tank didn’t burst, but leaked at 7.6 bar. This is a good result & supports idea of 304L stainless being better than 301. We’re developing our own alloy to take this even further. Leak before burst is highly desirable.

23 Jun 2020 - SN7 Pressure test to failure (< 8 Bar)
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02E5E1AA822C6E06349D</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">Test platform (SN7)</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24="><![CDATA[15 Jun 2020 - Test Tank SN7 pressure test
@elonmusk 16 Jun 2020:
Tank didn’t burst, but leaked at 7.6 bar. This is a good result & supports idea of 304L stainless being better than 301. We’re developing our own alloy to take this even further. Leak before burst is highly desirable.

23 Jun 2020 - SN7 Pressure test to failure (< 8 Bar)
]]></SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
