		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_32D8B85032953FBD">
			<name>Tank Testing Area</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Tank Testing Area</div><div><b>description</b>: 15 Mar 2021 - SN7.2 headed back to the production site
04 Feb 2021 - SN7.2 Pressure cryo test
26 Jan 2021 - SN7.2 pressure cryo test

@elonmusk 26 Jan 2020:
Passed initial pressure test

23 Sep 2020 - SN7.1 Pressure test to failure

@elonmusk 26 Sep 2020:
8 bar differential in ullage, 9 bar at base due to propellant head. It’s enough. Improvements in work.
</div>]]></description>
