			<name>StarHopper
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: StarHopper
</div><div><b>description</b>: Since 27 Aug 2019
Landing in 150 Meter StarHopper Test
Presently serving as a water tower and weather station.
Previously used as catering shelter.
Considered as Raptor test stand.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_6AC8AC15092C6E0634D8</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">StarHopper
</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">Since 27 Aug 2019
Landing in 150 Meter StarHopper Test
Presently serving as a water tower and weather station.
Previously used as catering shelter.
Considered as Raptor test stand.
</SimpleData>
