			<name>SpX Property 173048</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SpX Property 173048</div><div><b>description</b>: 5 Esperson St, Boca Chica, TX 78521

Quote Nomadd 22 Jan 2020:
" The old crackpot at 5 Esperson got tired of the drama and sold out.
 He almost got a Guinness tap and a lifetime supply of kegs, but the company did a little research on him and figured he'd bankrupt them within two years."
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0DF956D70E2C6E0634E3</styleUrl>
