			<name>Phobos</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Phobos</div><div><b>description</b>: Former position of offshore Starship launch platform. 
Since 02-Sep-2020 - 17-Jan-2021

Formerly oil rig "ENSCO 8501"

Galveston, Texas

@elonmusk 16 Jun 2020:
SpaceX is building floating, superheavy-class spaceports for Mars, moon & hypersonic travel around Earth
</div>]]></description>
