		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_179644796F5498C7">
			<name>McGregor Rocket Development and Test Facility</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: McGregor Rocket Development and Test Facility</div><div><b>description</b>: 1942-1945 - Bluebonnet Ordnance Plant - Army
1952-1958 - Phillips Petroleum Company / Air Force plant 66 (Jet Assisted Take-Off-JATO)
1958-1959 - Astrodyne (JATO / Finch and Castable Solid Motors)
1959-1978 - Rocketdyne (Sparrow, Sidewinder, and Phoenix / F-104 ZELL Booster)
1978-1995 - Hercules (Phoenix, Sidewinder, Sparrow, HARM, Sidearm, AMRAAM, and Chaparral Missles)
1997-2000 - Beal Aerospace (Commercial Space Venture)
2003- now - SpaceX

Drawn boundaries may have certain differences from reality.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_09955BE7452C6E0634EF</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
