		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28E45D94437BB69D">
			<name>Outdoor Materials Storage Area</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Outdoor Materials Storage Area</div><div><b>description</b>: The OMS area contains surplus metal, wood, and weather-proof ground support equipment. The OMS area also provides storage space for equipment storage containers and covered waste materials containers. Diesel and gasoline for ground vehicle fueling are stored in tanks within secondary containment structures located in the vehicle fueling area of the OMS. A locked ordnance locker is also located in this area.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_61723B7CE02C6E0634E9</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">Outdoor Materials Storage Area</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">The OMS area contains surplus metal, wood, and weather-proof ground support equipment. The OMS area also provides storage space for equipment storage containers and covered waste materials containers. Diesel and gasoline for ground vehicle fueling are stored in tanks within secondary containment structures located in the vehicle fueling area of the OMS. A locked ordnance locker is also located in this area.</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
