		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_30AC6030FD5A0E5E">
			<name>Proposed Missile And Space Park</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Proposed Missile And Space Park</div><div><b>description</b>: Proposed Park with approximately six static displays, landscaped trees, shrubbery, and lawns, hardscape pathways, and seating areas. 

The proposed artifacts would be emplaced in both vertical and horizontal exhibits, with the tallest artifact expected to be a Falcon 9 rocket standing at approximately 90 feet.

While the list of artifacts to be installed remains conceptual, anticipated artifact installations include the horizontal or vertical installation of a Falcon 9 rocket body (vertical), Minuteman (vertical), and Peacekeeper (horizontal).

https://media.defense.gov/2020/Jun/01/2002308897/-1/-1/1/LA%20AFB%20SPACE%20MISSILE%20PARK%20DEA_052820.PDF
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_02E5E1AA822C6E06349D</styleUrl>
