		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_205B0DC10CFE1390">
			<name>SpaceX-HT27 Facility
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SpaceX-HT27 Facility
</div><div><b>description</b>: HT27, 3715 Jack Northrop Ave

This area encompasses the main warehouse building and outdoor area surrounding the building. It consists of an outdoor storage area, recycled material collection bins, loading/unloading area, parking areas, and landscaping. All industrial activities (such as welding, and tooling) are done inside the warehouse building. There is also an outdoor shipping and receiving and associated outdoor storage area. There are no drains located in the loading/unloading area. Collected water in this area is discharged to the surface towards the nearby street surface storm drains via Run-off. Landscaping and vegetation can be found in the southwest portions of HT-27, but is not included within the confines of this SWPPP.
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0096B16A5F2C6E0634D5</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
