			<name>Outdoor Storage Area</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Outdoor Storage Area</div><div><b>description</b>: Fairing structures in area.

Area 1 consists of an outdoor storage area, recycled material collection bins, loading/unloading area, parking areas, and landscaping. All industrial activities (such as welding, and tooling) are done inside the warehouse building. Area 1 also contains an outdoor shipping and receiving and associated outdoor storage area.
</div>]]></description>
