		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28CE06EAAC59CAE8">
			<name>SpaceX-HT22 Building
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SpaceX-HT22 Building
</div><div><b>description</b>: HT22, 3715 Jack Northrop Ave, Hawthorne, CA 90250

This building contains the Ad Astra School grade school, a cafeteria, and SpaceX employee break room. No outdoor industrial practices occur at this site and although it is a SpaceX facility. 
This building is bordered by Triumph Group aerospace on its north side and a parking lot on its south side. It shares a common courtyard with the west side of HT-21. This area also contains an outdoorshipping and receiving and associated outdoor storage area.
</div>]]></description>
