			<name>SpaceX-HT21 Facility</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SpaceX-HT21 Facility</div><div><b>description</b>: HT21, 3715 Jack Northrop Ave, Hawthorne, CA 90250

Dragon production in West Campus Facility completely out of main HQ.
Former Triumph Aerostructures Building

kimbalmusk 25 May 2015:
View of @SpaceX from new Dragon building.

The western portion of this building is a multi-story office complex. All industrial activities such as welding and tooling are done inside the warehouse building. This area also contains an outdoor shipping and receiving and associated outdoor storage area.</div>]]></description>
