		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_205AFA90CA0892E2">
			<name>SpaceX-HT26 Facility “Dragon Lair”</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SpaceX-HT26 Facility “Dragon Lair”</div><div><b>description</b>: 3715 Jack Northrop ave
Bulid in Q1/2016.

 HT26 Facility

This area contains the “Dragon Lair”, which houses tooling to support mechanical assembly operations. The area also includes an enclosed spray booth to the east, a bulk compressed gas storage area to its west, and one covered area which houses storage for parts, inert materials, and equipment. There exists an outdoor storage
area, recycled material collection bins, loading/unloading area, parking areas, liquid argon and nitrogen storage tanks, and minimal landscaping. All industrial activities such as welding and tooling are done inside the warehouse building. This area also contains an outdoor shipping and receiving and associated
outdoor storage area.

Equipment List: dust collector cartridge type, abrasive blasting (cabinet/machine/room), oven-other, spray booth paint and solvent, tank, nitric acid
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_3DE8BF8EF92C6E0634C0</styleUrl>
