area, recycled material collection bins, loading/unloading area, parking areas, liquid argon and nitrogen storage tanks, and minimal landscaping. All industrial activities such as welding and tooling are done inside the warehouse building. This area also contains an outdoor shipping and receiving and associated
outdoor storage area.

