		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_205AF89D1C0B881C">
			<name>HT23 - SpaceX Health Center</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT23 - SpaceX Health Center</div><div><b>description</b>: 3615 Jack Northrop Ave, Hawthorne, CA 90250

HT23 Building

This area consists of “One Medical” clinic, composed of indoor office space with no industrial footprint, and the “Sarlacc Pit”, a 90-Day Waste Accumulation Area. The waste accumulation area is completely enclosed and has a comprehensive secondary containment system for any potential liquid release.
</div>]]></description>
