		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_205B49A72A186186">
			<name>SpaceX Outdoor Storage Area</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SpaceX Outdoor Storage Area</div><div><b>description</b>: Area 1 consists of an outdoor storage area recycled material collection bins, loading/unloading area, and parking areas.
All industrial activities (i.e. welding, and tooling) are done inside the warehouse building. Area 1 also contains an outdoor shipping and receiving and associated outdoor storage area. There is one sump pump located in the loading/unloading area having two drains.

F9 octowebs in area
</div>]]></description>
