		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28CFE2D680477712">
			<name>HT05 - R&amp;D Machining</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT05 - R&D Machining</div><div><b>description</b>: 3321 Jack Northrop Ave.

This area contains Building 3321, a flame test lab, high temperature composite lab, and outdoor storage for parts, equipment, metal turnings, and bulk chemicals. Building 3321 contains a machine shop where research and development takes place. Occasionally, material production occurs in the building. Trash and recycling bins are also located in this area.</div>]]></description>
