		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28D2E8D980AF487B">
			<name>HT16 - Production Testing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT16 - Production Testing</div><div><b>description</b>: 3319 Jack Northrop Ave.

This area consists of Building 3319, metal turnings, Octaweb test area, and recycled materials collection and storage area. Non-destructive testing is performed in this area (HT-04) to examine materials for defects. These tests involve x-rays and penetrant methods using ZYGLO™ and Met-L Check™. Plastic, cardboard, scrap wood, and other recyclable materials are stored within the outdoor area.</div>]]></description>
