			<name>HT15 - Structures Testing</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT15 - Structures Testing</div><div><b>description</b>: 3315 Jack Northrop Ave.

This area consists of Buildings 3313 and 3315, a covered storage area and a dust collection system. The covered storage area covers metal turnings, fresh oil, and lubricants. Both buildings house machine shops where sheet metal work occurs (deburring and routing/structure testing). Building 3315 is located adjacent to Tow World Building 3305.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0096B16A5F2C6E0634D5</styleUrl>
