This area consists of Buildings 3313 and 3315, a covered storage area and a dust collection system. The covered storage area covers metal turnings, fresh oil, and lubricants. Both buildings house machine shops where sheet metal work occurs (deburring and routing/structure testing). Building 3315 is located adjacent to Tow World Building 3305.</SimpleData>
