		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_205B4C6DE0005FCE">
			<name>HT18 - XBox</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT18 - XBox</div><div><b>description</b>: 3301 Jack Northrop Ave.

HT-18 is a gated area housing Building 3301 (known as X-Box), recycled material, trash dumpsters, hazardous waste storage, oil and lubricants, metal turnings, parts, equipment, and other miscellaneous materials related to manufacturing. In X-Box, pressure testing of parts and equipment is a frequent occurrence. The lot is enclosed by a locked chain-link fence and is paved.

Equipment List: wax burn-off oven, dust collector/hepa, other r-1401 toxics, cyclone, furnace elect ind & res misc metals

Built in Feb 2018

Former SpaceX Scrap Yard
</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0096B16A5F2C6E0634D5</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
