			<name>HT17 - Cerise Facility </name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT17 - Cerise Facility </div><div><b>description</b>: 12524 Cerise Ave, Hawthorne, CA 90250

Propulsion Production (One-Stop Tube Shop)

Operations at the Cerise Site include the use of water jet cutting, hazardous material storage, and pipe fitting fabrication

Starship equipment (Leg Calipers)

Equipment List: oven, plastic/resin curing, spray booth paint and solvent, misc materials cleaning, dust collector cartridge type, oven, baking
</div>]]></description>
