		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28D2D9CFADF053D7">
			<name>HT08 - Propulsion R&amp;D</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT08 - Propulsion R&D</div><div><b>description</b>: 3133B Jack Northrop Ave.

Building 3133B has split occupancy with 1540 Productions to the west while SpaceX occupies the eastern portion. This area also contains a sheet metal shop, fabrication equipment, shipping and receiving areas for finished product and raw materials. Parts and equipment are stored outside in the open area between Buildings 3133B and 3125.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0096B16A5F2C6E0634D5</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
