					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">3133B Jack Northrop Ave.

Building 3133B has split occupancy with 1540 Productions to the west while SpaceX occupies the eastern portion. This area also contains a sheet metal shop, fabrication equipment, shipping and receiving areas for finished product and raw materials. Parts and equipment are stored outside in the open area between Buildings 3133B and 3125.</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
