		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_205AF4C482876DB9">
			<name>HT03 - Shipping &amp; Receiving</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT03 - Shipping & Receiving</div><div><b>description</b>: 3125 Jack Northrop Ave., Hawthorne, CA 90250
Building HT03

This area contains Building 3125, a shipping/receiving area for finished product, raw materials, parts, equipment storage area, and a
welding station. Municipal trash bins are also located in this area. A grated trench drain and drain inlet are located on the west side of Building 3125. A sump is located at the east side of Building 3125.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0096B16A5F2C6E0634D5</styleUrl>
