					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">3125 Jack Northrop Ave., Hawthorne, CA 90250
Building HT03

This area contains Building 3125, a shipping/receiving area for finished product, raw materials, parts, equipment storage area, and a
welding station. Municipal trash bins are also located in this area. A grated trench drain and drain inlet are located on the west side of Building 3125. A sump is located at the east side of Building 3125.</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
