			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT06 - SpaceX North - Offices</div><div><b>description</b>: 12259 Crenshaw Blvd.

This area contains HT-06 Building 12259 (offices), outdoor food court, two large outdoor trash compactors, compressed air tanks of propane, and a 55-gallon oil drum within a secondary containment over pack drum.
</div>]]></description>
