		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28CFEBB4911D6CA2">
			<name>HT02 - Engine Shop</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT02 - Engine Shop</div><div><b>description</b>: 3317 Jack Northrop Ave., Hawthorne, CA 90250

Building 3117 consists of machining equipment, air conditioners, air compressors, a test building, and a plasma spray booth. Additionally, the air conditioners and the planters south of the building are associated with operations here. The Plasma Spray Booth, Testing Building and Gate #2 are also located in the general area. The Carbon Over-wrap Pressure Vessel (COPV) is received, inspected and then sent off for precision cleaning. Miscellaneous parts and equipment for manufacturing are stored near Gate #2.</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_6B4502E5A02C6E0634EF</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">HT02 - Engine Shop</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">3317 Jack Northrop Ave., Hawthorne, CA 90250

Building 3117 consists of machining equipment, air conditioners, air compressors, a test building, and a plasma spray booth. Additionally, the air conditioners and the planters south of the building are associated with operations here. The Plasma Spray Booth, Testing Building and Gate #2 are also located in the general area. The Carbon Over-wrap Pressure Vessel (COPV) is received, inspected and then sent off for precision cleaning. Miscellaneous parts and equipment for manufacturing are stored near Gate #2.</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
