		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_205B5F813816A8CD">
			<name>B1019 monument</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: B1019 monument</div><div><b>description</b>: Falcon 9 recovered first stage display - world's first orbital-class rocket landing on Dec 21, 2015

Flight F9-021 with OG-2 Mission 2, booster B1019, completely repainted.
Leg pistons are flown hardware of Flight 25 (Thaicom-8 mission - case of crushed core inside the lowermost cylinder).

HQ corner, intersection of Crenshaw Blvd. and Jack Northrop Ave., Hawthorne, California</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0F4F6D96952C6E0634FE</styleUrl>
