Flight F9-021 with OG-2 Mission 2, booster B1019, completely repainted.
Leg pistons are flown hardware of Flight 25 (Thaicom-8 mission - case of crushed core inside the lowermost cylinder).

HQ corner, intersection of Crenshaw Blvd. and Jack Northrop Ave., Hawthorne, California</SimpleData>
