		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_28D7C309B3486AFA">
			<name>HT13 - R&amp;D Structures</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: HT13 - R&D Structures</div><div><b>description</b>: 12681 Crenshaw Blvd, Hawthorne, CA 90250

The southernmost suite of the SpaceX Tooling Site contains a structures research and development laboratory. It contains a thermal lab, an acid lab, and two pyrolyzing CMC furnaces. Various testing, lamination, fabrication, and tooling processes occur in the research and development laboratory. All these processes occur indoors and present little potential for storm water pollution. The outdoor portion of Area 2 includes landscaping, parking, and sample location</div>]]></description>
			<styleUrl>#__managed_style_6B4502E5A02C6E0634EF</styleUrl>
			<ExtendedData>
				<SchemaData schemaUrl="#__managed_schema">
					<SimpleData name="str:bmFtZQ==">HT13 - R&amp;D Structures</SimpleData>
					<SimpleData name="str:ZGVzY3JpcHRpb24=">12681 Crenshaw Blvd, Hawthorne, CA 90250

The southernmost suite of the SpaceX Tooling Site contains a structures research and development laboratory. It contains a thermal lab, an acid lab, and two pyrolyzing CMC furnaces. Various testing, lamination, fabrication, and tooling processes occur in the research and development laboratory. All these processes occur indoors and present little potential for storm water pollution. The outdoor portion of Area 2 includes landscaping, parking, and sample location</SimpleData>
				</SchemaData>
			</ExtendedData>
