			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Former position of F1-006-S1 & F1-000-S1-tank</div><div><b>description</b>: SpaceX Scrap Yard

Falcon 1 006 first stage weaning- removed 7/2018
- Merlin engine, white stage, black interstage
- Originally intended for F1-006 TacSat-1A mission.

&
Prototype Falcon 1 000 first stage tank remnants - removed 7/2018
- metallic silver, with SpaceX logo, just tightly at the fence.
- introduced in 04 Dec 2003 - First Falcon1 unveiled at the National Air and Space Museum in Washington DC.

http://www.thespacereview.com/article/70/1

11 Jul 2018 - Both F1 parts removed possibly in order to display it (rocket garden).</div>]]></description>
