		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_207E9869B8FBA318">
			<name>Adjacent courtyard</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Adjacent courtyard</div><div><b>description</b>: Area 1 consists of an outdoor storage area recycled material collection bins, loading/unloading area, parking areas, a diesel above ground storage tank (AST), liquid argon and nitrogen storage tanks, outdoor portable freezers, and landscaping. 
Area 1 also contains an outdoor shipping and receiving and associated outdoor storage area. There are two sump pumps located in the loading/unloading area.
</div>]]></description>
