			<name>SpaceX Parking Area</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: SpaceX Parking Area</div><div><b>description</b>: SpaceX "Red Permit Parking Only"

Area 2 is located south of Area 1 on the corner of El Segundo Boulevard and Wilkie Avenue in the southwest corner of the Site. Area 2 consists of outdoor parking areas, a loading/unloading zone, and vegetated landscaping. The vegetated landscaping is located throughout the parking areas.</div>]]></description>
