		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_20BC11D09616CE6C">
			<name>Former BFR tent
</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Former BFR tent
</div><div><b>description</b>: 801 REEVES AVE, SAN PEDRO

12 Mar 2019: Tent is taken down as Starship/SuperHeavy was changed to stainless steel.

Tent with jig tool for construction of carbon fiber full-scale composite section of BFR interplanetary spaceship.
Jig tool made by Ascent Aerospace Coast Composites.

@elonmusk 09 Apr 2018
SpaceX main body tool for the BFR interplanetary spaceship

https://www.portoflosangeles.org/Board/2017/November%202017/111617_Regular_Agenda_Item_I.pdf

https://www.portoflosangeles.org/Board/2017/November%202017/111617_Regular_Agenda_Item_I_Transmittal_2.pdf

TerraServer link: https://www.terraserver.com/view?utf8=%E2%9C%93&search_text=33.75347%2C+-118.24851&searchLat=&searchLng=
</div>]]></description>
