		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_2067C6A382099FD2">
			<name>Proposed East Coast Loop</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Proposed East Coast Loop</div><div><b>description</b>: DC-to-Baltimore Transit Tunnel Project - parallel, twin underground tunnels. Approx.14 ft apart underground and will run in parallel for approx. 35.3 miles beneath public right-of-way from DC-to-Baltimore. Each tunnel has a boring diameter of 14.0 feet, an outer diameter of 13.5 feet, and an inner diameter of 12.0 feet.

https://policymanual.mdot.maryland.gov/mediawiki/images/9/91/20180218_DC-to-Baltimore_Transit_Tunnel_Summary.pdf
https://www.boringcompany.com/eastcoast/
</div>]]></description>
