		<Placemark id="4c5ae659_1CEFF92F554A74C8">
			<name>Destructive test of 12m LOX tank</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div><b>name</b>: Destructive test of 12m LOX tank</div><div><b>description</b>: 09 Feb 2017 - Destructive test of Liquid Oxygen Carbon Fiber Development Prototype Tank.

12m diameter, pressure tested to 2.3atm, volume 1000m3, holds 1200 tons of LOX

Burst pressure above the design pressure.
Performed on the barge, towed by Ocean Ranger tug.

 Bellingham Bay, WA
</div>]]></description>
